  "usa_corp_ww": "UASD (United American Strategic Department)\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ww_des": "Corporation profile: coordination of the Truhold-Markson's army\r\n\r\nPrimary police force of Truhold-Markson. Officially a member of the coalition forces controlled by Syndicate, but the T-M uses this establishment for its own purposes at times.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_wi": "Ponter-Lassax ltd.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_wi_des": "Corporation profile: research in military industry, weapon manufacturing\r\n\r\nCanada's main war material supplier acquired its monopole state during the great war. The corporation has started promising agricultural researches for wartime purposes recently.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ws": "Immortal Security\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ws_des": "Corporation profile: safeguarding, military intelligence\r\n\r\nThis French originated mercenary corporation relocated its headquarters after the war to the United States. The corporation's primary role is to protect T-M premises on interstellar colonies.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ii": "Penntyte\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ii_des": "Corporation profile: exploitation and transportation of raw materials\r\n\r\nCompared to Nian manufacturing technologies, the terran industry seemed a bit primitive, but the lately adapted inventions gave a push to several industrial sectors. Penntyte is now one of the most prosperous companies thanks to innovations.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_iw": "Gremlon ltd.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_iw_des": "Corporation profile: high-tech development, warfare supplier\r\n\r\nGremlon is the main supplier of the Truhold-Markson's army. The corporation's interests include mineral exploitation, transportation and refinement Nianwide.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_is": "American Electrical Engineering Conglomerate\n  ",
  "usa_corp_is_des": "Corporation profile: constructions, logistics, microelectronic researches\r\n\r\nThe production of neuroimplants has been the main profile of the corporation for decades, but the maintenance of T-M's communication system seems a lot more profitable.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_sw": "Steltec\n  ",
  "usa_corp_sw_des": "Corporation profile: home and external trade, foreign affairs\r\n\r\nSteltec was the first aspirant corporation when the US government finally lifted the monopoly of space research. All the experience gained in interplanetary trading contributes to the corporation's success on the planet Nia.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_si": "Webb & Webb\n  ",
  "usa_corp_si_des": "Corporation profile: trade supervision\r\n\r\nExternal trade and transportation transactor corporation of the Truhold-Markson. Webb&Webb has always been a dominant logistics corporation in the history of the US.\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ss": "C&M Communications\n  ",
  "usa_corp_ss_des": "Corporation profile: infrastructure development, logistics\r\n\r\nOriginally one among many North American communications corporation, C&M now coordinates Truhold-Markson logistics both on Earth and Nia.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ww": "DFD - Department of Federated Defense\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ww_des": "Head department of the ICS' police force and coordinator of military research.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_wi": "Gamaul Martial Technologies & Research\n  ",
  "eu_corp_wi_des": "Corporation profile: auxiliary martial research and production\r\n\r\nThe construction and commission of satellites in the Solar System was profitable enough for Gamaul to become one of the wealthiest enterprises worldwide. The company drew ICS' attention with successful researches in nanotechnology and the so-called 'star wars'.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ws": "Znatwoy Armament\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ws_des": "Corporation profile: weapon trading, military researches\r\n\r\nThe Russian Znatwoy had supplied of the common European army with the latest military innovations, currently liable for ICS army supplies.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_iw": "Vettelstec\n  ",
  "eu_corp_iw_des": "Corporation profile: weapon manufacturing\r\n\r\nSince the Danish-Dutch Vettelstec is an independent enterprise, it had to buy its share in the Perpetuum Project to join the fabulously profitable weapon industry as an outsider.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ii": "DFI - Department of Federated Industry\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ii_des": "Head department, liable for aligning Nian industry.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_is": "Nanouval\n  ",
  "eu_corp_is_des": "Corporation profile: mining, trade, constructions\r\n\r\nThe Swedish Nanouval joined the interplanetary trade business decades ago. That experience helped the corporation to attain a place in the ICS-led invasion of Nia.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_sw": "Armetra Enterprise\n  ",
  "eu_corp_sw_des": "Corporation profile: military guidance\r\n\r\nArmetra's primary role is to provide rookie Agents with proper military training, and to adapt the newest military technology.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_si": "Geysier-Kronwerk\n  ",
  "eu_corp_si_des": "Corporation profile: trade, transportation\r\n\r\nThe German mogul, Geysier-Kronwerk manages the internal and external transportation of ICS with remarkable influence and power.\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ss": "DFC - Department of Federated Coordination\n  ",
  "eu_corp_ss_des": "Coordinations office under the supervision of the ICS head council.\n  ",
