  "def_standard_powergrid_upgrades_desc": "Auxiliary reactor grids in the Coreactor slightly increase the main reactor's performance.\n  ",
  "def_standard_sensor_booster": "Standard sensor amplifier\n  ",
  "def_zmall_railg00n_desc": "\"Hasta la vista, baby!\"\n  ",
  "def_zupalight_desc": "Noone actually remembers what this was supposed to be or what this does. It's not even in the game. To be honest, now the only purpose it really has is to provide the translators with some extra work.\n  ",
  "reconnect": "Reconnecting...\n  ",
