  "def_ammo_railgun_b_desc": "The aggressive reagent inside the slug core begins to disrupt armor structure right from the moment of the impact.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_railgun_c_desc": "The liquid placed inside the slug's core causes a larger impact force with its inertia, damaging deeper layers of the armor.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_railgun_d_desc": "The brand new compositecore technology in magnetic slugs made it possible to reach an immense force at impact. The kinetic effect is significant compared to other slugs.\n  ",
