  "def_ammo_projectile_b_desc": "The ceramic inlay protects the incendiary core to preserve its secondary thermal effect after the impact.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_projectile_c_desc": "The mixed bullet core provides an optimal combination of all damage types.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_projectile_d_desc": "This polynitrocol-based bullet has the largest overall damage, with a significant range penalty.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_rocket_a_desc": "'''Long ranged missile'''\r\n\r\nThe missile's warhead damages both the surface and deeper layers of enemy armor.\n  ",
