  "def_ammo_rocket_c_desc": "'''Long ranged missile'''\r\n\r\nThe initial impact on the armor surface induces a high temperature explosion, which ignites the phlobotil inside the missile core. This smouldering substance causes an additional thermal damage to the armor.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_missile_c_desc": "'''Short ranged missile'''\r\n\r\nThe initial impact on the armor surface induces a high temperature explosion, which ignites the phlobotil inside the missile core. This smouldering substance causes an additional thermal damage to the armor.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_cruisemissile_c_desc": "'''Short ranged missile'''\r\n\r\nThe initial impact on the armor surface induces a high temperature explosion, which ignites the phlobotil inside the missile core. This smouldering substance causes an additional thermal damage to the armor.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_rocket_d_desc": "'''Long ranged missile'''\r\n\r\nThe missile generates seismic waves in the armor's deeper layers after the explosion.\n  ",
  "def_ammo_missile_d_desc": "'''Short ranged missile'''\r\n\r\nThe missile generates seismic waves in the armor's deeper layers after the explosion.\n  ",
