  "def_helioptris_desc": "The most common domesticated plant on Nia. Helioptris is a result of genetic engineering, and is mainly used for manufacturing plastics and explosives.\n  ",
  "def_named2_reactor_sealing_cprg": "GRIP-250 reactor sealing CT\n  ",
  "def_named2_sensor_supressor_booster_cprg": "Radiocor sensor suppressor tuning CT\n  ",
  "def_named3_ecm_booster_cprg": "Sludge ECM tuning CT\n  ",
  "def_named3_energy_warfare_upgrade_cprg": "XT-Shock EnWar upgrade CT\n  ",
  "def_named3_reactor_sealing_cprg": "GRIP-500p reactor sealing CT\n  ",
  "def_named3_sensor_supressor_booster_cprg": "DDX700-Mist sensor suppressor tuning CT\n  ",
  "def_pbs_armor_repairer_large_capsule_cprg": "Hi-tech repair node foundation CT\n  ",
  "def_pbs_armor_repairer_medium_capsule_cprg": "Advanced repair node foundation CT\n  ",
  "def_triandlus_desc": "Climbing plant, used for manufacturing basic bioelectric instruments and new energy sources.\n  ",
  "def_terraform_buoy_capsule": "Terraformer beacon\n  ",
  "cf_terraform_buoy_capsule": "Terraformer beacons\n  ",
  "def_terraform_buoy": "Terraformer beacon\n  ",
  "def_named1_ecm_booster_cprg": "Distortio ECM tuning CT\n  ",
  "def_named1_energy_warfare_upgrade_cprg": "Blister EnWar upgrade CT\n  ",
  "def_prismocitae_desc": "Machine industry makes good use of prismocitae's superefficient regenerating attribute by making hybrid tissues and bionic instruments.\n  ",
  "def_titanium_desc": "Titanium can be extracted from titan ore. Pure titanium - ready for factorial work - is the most prevalent commodity in Nian machine industry.\n  ",
  "def_plasteosine_desc": "The starch in HDT is able to blend with titanium on high temperature. The outcome is plasteosine, a strong plastic, component of many additional electronic devices.\n  ",
  "def_isopropentol_desc": "During the refinement of HDT - with the addition of other materials - the highly flammable isopropentol can be made. Efficient energy source: its heat of combustion exceeds common benzine.\n  ",
  "def_vitricyl_desc": "Vitricyl is a much lighter and stronger plastic than plasteosine.\n  ",
  "def_metachropin_desc": "This faceted crystal with useful optical attributes is extracted from the raw stermonit ore. The purified metachropin is mainly used for optical instruments and high-powered lasers.\n  ",
  "def_prilumium_desc": "This rare, crystal structured material is used for manufacturing optical instruments and lasers. The creation of prilumium requires the Nian crude oil - HDT, Prismocitae and Stermonit.\n  ",
  "def_statichnol_desc": "You can gain this considerably useful commodity from the imentium rock. Statichnol is a fluid with high viscosity, but it gets more solid than titan under electromagnetic impact.\n  ",
  "def_phlobotil_desc": "Phlobotil is used especially for military purposes. After a long, complicated refinement process, this safely containable explosive can be made from the combination of Silgium, Liquizit and Triandlus.\n  ",
  "def_chollonin_desc": "This commodity can be extracted from imentium, which is contaminated with useless excretas. It is used similarly to titanium, to produce robotic chassis, but the crystal structure makes chollonin much more stable.\n  ",
  "def_alligior_desc": "By combining titan ore, HDT and epriton, the extremely strong and resistant alligior can be made. This alloy provides the massiveness, that larger robot categories require.\n  ",
  "def_polynucleit_desc": "Liquid polynucleit is needed for the manufacturing of large robots. This efficient catalyst and energy source can be synthesized from Stermonit, Liquizit and Prismocitae.\n  ",
  "def_hydrobenol_desc": "Hydrobenol is the only substance that can start the cold fusion. Extremely useful but highly unstable energy source at the same time.\n  ",
  "def_espitium_desc": "Espitium is the firmest solid superconductor known - more advanced than Cryoperine. Since it doesn't have any electrical resistance, it remains a first-rate material for robotic components.\n  ",
