  "def_named_driller_desc": "A single miner module consists of two main parts: a seismic generator and a high-performance laser. The generator shakes up separate ground layers with multi-frequency waves, then the laser heats up the remaining debris, causing valuable materials to emerge in plasma-like form. This process makes mining possible in high-pressured and ultra solid layers.\n  ",
