  "def_named_sensor_dampener_desc": "The suppressor uses multiple frequencies to disturb radar waves. Due to constant strain, enemy targeting computers are forced to lock targets slower, and from shorter distance.\n  ",
  "sensor_strength_modifier": "Passive sensor strength modification\n  ",
  "def_named_eccm_desc": "By using polarization, spectral and frequency hopping methods, the module can prevent your sensors being jammed by enemy ECMs.\n  ",
