  "def_mining_probe_module_desc": "'''Only one geoscanner can be equipped at a time.'''\r\n\r\nGeoscanners show the location of underground raw materials by examining the wave reflection of each ground layer. The geoscanner uses tile and area based charges as well.\n  ",
  "def_gang_assist_information_module_desc": "''Module recommended to squad leaders.''\r\n\r\nThe module increases targeting range of all squad members, who are entitled to receive squad bonuses. The effect only prevails in case the module is used by the squad leader. You can read more about bonuses and squad numbers [[Help:Gangs|here]].\n  ",
  "def_gang_assist_speed_module_desc": "''Module recommended to squad leaders.''\r\n\r\nThe module increases the top speed of all squad members, who are entitled to receive squad bonuses. The effect only prevails in case the module is used by the squad leader. You can read more about bonuses and squad numbers [[Help:Gangs|here]].\n  ",
  "def_gang_assist_industry_module_desc": "''Module recommended to squad leaders.''\r\n\r\nThe module increases the mining and harvesting speed of all squad members, who are entitled to receive squad bonuses. The effect only prevails in case the module is used by the squad leader. You can read more about bonuses and squad numbers [[Help:Gangs|here]].\n  ",
  "def_gang_assist_siege_module_desc": "''Module recommended to squad leaders.''\r\n\r\nThe module increases optimal range of all weapons used by squad members, who are entitled to receive squad bonuses. The effect only prevails in case the module is used by the squad leader. You can read more about bonuses and squad numbers [[Help:Gangs|here]].\n  ",
  "def_gang_assist_defense_module_desc": "''Module recommended to squad leaders.''\r\n\r\nThe module increases HP of all squad members, who are entitled to receive squad bonuses. The effect only prevails in case the module is used by the squad leader. You can read more about bonuses and squad numbers [[Help:Gangs|here]].\n  ",
