  "def_noob_driller_desc": "'''Equipment manufactured by the Syndicate'''\r\n\r\nA single miner module consists two main parts: a seismic generator and a high-performance laser. The generator shakes up separate ground layers with multi-frequency waves, then the laser heats up the remaining debris, causing valuable materials to emerge in plasma-like form. This process makes mining possible in high-pressured and ultra solid layers.\r\n\r\nSyndicate products cannot be repaired.\n  ",
