  "def_unique_item_for_tm_mission_001": "Magnetic-sealed cargo\n  ",
  "missiontype_onlykill_level01_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 1[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe contractor wants you to wipe out some small native robots on the newly gained territories. That means you should equip your robot with weapons and take some ammunition with yourself and when you finish the job, you get your money right away.\n  ",
  "missiontype_killandfetch_level01_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 1[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, your task will be to destroy the enemy robots in the marked area and take the confidential target items from their cargo hold. The corporation that hired you needs every bit of information about those robots, so you'll be rewarded when you deliver the consoles... and don't forget to take weapons with ammunition.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_material_level01_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 1[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level01_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 1[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to [b]equip a chassis scanner[/b] of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
  "missiontype_mining_level01_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 1[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn order to rev up the Nian economy, the Syndicate provides financial support to every Agent who is willing to exploit raw materials. You should equip an industrial robot with several miner modules, and a large portion of the appropriate miner charges. Dig out the minerals and you get the reward.\n  ",
  "missiontype_courier_level01_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 1[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYour task is nothing more than to deliver the packages you've been given. It's not always as easy as it sounds - the total volume of the package can exceed a regular robot's cargo, forcing you to do several turns with your robot. Also, on a long trip you might want to opt for military assistance to reach your destination safely.\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_box_desc": "This magnetic-sealed storage device is the most secure portable safe known. Its electromagnetic seal makes it almost impossible for any unauthorized person to decode or open it.\n  ",
