  "missiontype_mining_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn order to rev up the Nian economy, the Syndicate provides financial support to every Agent who is willing to exploit raw materials. You should equip an industrial robot with several miner modules, and a large portion of the appropriate miner charges. Dig out the minerals and you get the reward.\n  ",
  "missiontype_mining_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn order to rev up the Nian economy, the Syndicate provides financial support to every Agent who is willing to exploit raw materials. You should equip an industrial robot with several miner modules, and a large portion of the appropriate miner charges. Dig out the minerals and you get the reward.\n  ",
  "missiontype_onlykill_level02_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 2[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe contractor wants you to wipe out some small native robots on the newly gained territories. That means you should equip your robot with weapons and take some ammunition with yourself and when you finish the job, you get your money right away.\n  ",
  "missiontype_onlykill_level03_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 3[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe contractor wants you to wipe out some small native robots on the newly gained territories. That means you should equip your robot with weapons and take some ammunition with yourself and when you finish the job, you get your money right away.\n  ",
  "missiontype_onlykill_level04_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 4[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe contractor wants you to wipe out some small native robots on the newly gained territories. That means you should equip your robot with weapons and take some ammunition with yourself and when you finish the job, you get your money right away.\n  ",
  "missiontype_onlykill_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe contractor wants you to wipe out some small native robots on the newly gained territories. That means you should equip your robot with weapons and take some ammunition with yourself and when you finish the job, you get your money right away.\n  ",
  "missiontype_onlykill_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe contractor wants you to wipe out some small native robots on the newly gained territories. That means you should equip your robot with weapons and take some ammunition with yourself and when you finish the job, you get your money right away.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_material_level02_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 2[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_material_level03_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 3[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
