  "missiontype_scan_material_level04_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 4[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_material_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_material_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level02_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 2[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to equip a chassis scanner of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level03_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 3[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to equip a chassis scanner of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level04_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 4[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to equip a chassis scanner of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to equip a chassis scanner of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to equip a chassis scanner of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scanandloot_level02_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 2[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYour primary task is to create some images of the target robots, so you will need a chassis scanner for this assignment. The data you collect about them is of great importance to our troops. And while you're there, get rid of those junks, will you?\n  ",
  "missiontype_scanandloot_level03_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 3[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYour primary task is to create some images of the target robots, so you will need a chassis scanner for this assignment. The data you collect about them is of great importance to our troops. And while you're there, get rid of those junks, will you?\n  ",
  "missiontype_scanandloot_level04_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 4[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYour primary task is to create some images of the target robots, so you will need a chassis scanner for this assignment. The data you collect about them is of great importance to our troops. And while you're there, get rid of those junks, will you?\n  ",
  "missiontype_scanandloot_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYour primary task is to create some images of the target robots, so you will need a chassis scanner for this assignment. The data you collect about them is of great importance to our troops. And while you're there, get rid of those junks, will you?\n  ",
  "missiontype_scanandloot_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYour primary task is to create some images of the target robots, so you will need a chassis scanner for this assignment. The data you collect about them is of great importance to our troops. And while you're there, get rid of those junks, will you?\n  ",
  "missiontype_huntthescout_level03_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 3[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe targets we marked for you are heavily armed and dangerous. You need to take out them as soon as you can before they destroy any more of our properties, but approach them with extreme caution! Bring back any valuable data you find!\n  ",
  "missiontype_huntthescout_level04_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 4[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe targets we marked for you are heavily armed and dangerous. You need to take out them as soon as you can before they destroy any more of our properties, but approach them with extreme caution! Bring back any valuable data you find!\n  ",
  "missiontype_huntthescout_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe targets we marked for you are heavily armed and dangerous. You need to take out them as soon as you can before they destroy any more of our properties, but approach them with extreme caution! Bring back any valuable data you find!\n  ",
  "missiontype_huntthescout_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThe targets we marked for you are heavily armed and dangerous. You need to take out them as soon as you can before they destroy any more of our properties, but approach them with extreme caution! Bring back any valuable data you find!\n  ",
  "missiontype_defendandmine_level03_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 3[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThis could be tough for a regular industryman: the area where you are asked to mine is not exactly a peaceful one. It's strongly recommended to bring some extra gunmen with yourself if you don't want to get your robot popped in a minute.\n  ",
  "missiontype_defendandmine_level04_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 4[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThis could be tough for a regular industryman: the area where you are asked to mine is not exactly a peaceful one. It's strongly recommended to bring some extra gunmen with yourself if you don't want to get your robot popped in a minute.\n  ",
  "missiontype_defendandmine_level05_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 5[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThis could be tough for a regular industryman: the area where you are asked to mine is not exactly a peaceful one. It's strongly recommended to bring some extra gunmen with yourself if you don't want to get your robot popped in a minute.\n  ",
  "missiontype_defendandmine_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nThis could be tough for a regular industryman: the area where you are asked to mine is not exactly a peaceful one. It's strongly recommended to bring some extra gunmen with yourself if you don't want to get your robot popped in a minute.\n  ",
  "missiontype_retrive_level06_desc": "[b]Confidentiality level: 6[/b]\r\n\r\n[i]The higher the confidentiality level is, the more difficult the assignment will be. Prepare yourself accordingly![/i]\r\n\r\nYou need to retrieve a package for us, but it's heavily guarded. You might need to recruit a squad if you wish to succeed. Also, this package might exceed a regular robot's cargo hold, you should also bring a robot specialized in transportation as well to bring the target item back.\n  ",
