  "missiontype_killandfetch_level00_desc": "[b]Beginner assignment.[/b]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment you need to destroy the target robots, take out every important item from their container and bring them back.\r\n\r\nAll the targets are easy to handle, the difficulty is suitable for any rookie Agent. Recommended equipment:\r\n\r\n* At least one weapon module of your choice\r\n* Ammunition to this weapon, at least 200 pieces\r\n* Armor repairer module in order to fix any damages on your robot\n  ",
