  "def_mobile_teleport_capsule_standard_desc": "Once deployed on the field, mobile teleport beacons connect to the existing teleport tower networks and allow for quick extraction of robots over great distances. Only Agents within the same squad can use a deployed teleport beacon.\r\n\r\nThis teleport beacon is a basic type with normal armor and standard operational times.\n  ",
