  "def_noob_chassis_scanner": "Syn-tec chassis scanner\n  ",
  "def_noob_chassis_scanner_desc": "'''Equipment manufactured by the Syndicate'''\r\n\r\nChassis scanners, a.k.a. the 'frisk scanners' help you to scout the equipment of enemy robots.\r\n\r\nSyndicate products cannot be recycled.\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_01": "This is your first tutorial assignment. The task is simple: you need to reach all four patrolling points, any order is accepted. After you've reached all four points, the assignment is completed and you will get your reward.\r\n\r\nThe target points are on the terrain nearby the terminal, so you need to deploy onto the terrain. If you succeed, come back to take the 2nd file of tutorial assignments.\r\n\r\nOh, and remember the things you've learned during your tutorials. Open the windows that can help you to complete the tasks, especially the assignment window that shows the objectives.\r\n\r\n[b]After accepting, click on the 'Deploy' button in the middle of the top menubar and complete the assignment on the terrain.[/b]\n  ",
  "succesmessage_tutorial": "Assignment completed\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_02": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #2\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_02": "Congratulations on completing the first tutorial assignment!\r\n\r\nThe next one will test your fighting skills. Deploy onto the terrain and destroy the robots [b]in the marked area[/b].\r\n\r\nYou've learned how to equip your robot, it is time to use your knowledge: equip as many weapons as you can onto your robot in order to reach maximum damage, and don't forget to fill them with ammunition!\r\n\r\n[b]If you're finished, come back to take the 3rd tutorial assignment.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_03-a": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #3-a\n  ",
  "missiontarget_tutorial_reachposition_tm_stage_03-a_01": "Reach position then teleport to Sangutal, Daoden\n  ",
  "missiontarget_tutorial_reachposition_tm_stage_03-a_02": "Reach and enter the marked terminal\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_03-a_tm": "We need you to travel to another terminal to get something for us. First, go to the designated teleport (at objective A) and travel to Daoden. If you get there, follow the second objective point and enter the Asintec Alpha Terminal.\r\n\r\n[b]When you get inside the other terminal, look for the 'Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #3-b'.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_03": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #3-b\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_03": "This is an introduction to transportation assignments. We enclose a 'Data console' that holds valuable information. You cannot open it or use it, the only thing you need to do is to bring this item to the designated delivery point through the marked waypoints.\r\n\r\nThe assignment does not end when you enter the target terminal, you will still need to open this assignment's page and click on 'Deliver'.\r\n\r\nThe data console will be placed into your 'Private storage' here after you accept this assignment. To transport it, you need to open your robot's cargo hold (right-click on your robot) and drag the data console into it.\r\n\r\n[b]When you get there, look for File #4 of the tutorial assignments![/b]\n  ",
  "missiontarget_tutorial_reachposition_tm_stage_03-b_01": "Reach position then teleport to Fort Donnerth, New Virginia\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_tm_stage_03": "SynSec container [Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #3-b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_04": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #4\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_04": "This one isn't going to be as easy as it seems. You need to take out a small squad of enemy robots in the marked area to succeed. Try to equip better weapons with larger damage rate.\r\n\r\nThis time the reward is something special, you get an upgraded version of your service robot, an Arkhe Mk2, along with some equipment that you'll need for your next assignment.\r\n\r\n[b]If you're finished, come back for file #5.[/b]\n  ",
  "def_arkhe2_bot_desc": "The Arkhe Mk2 is a slightly upgraded version of the original Arkhe. Arkhe Mk2 can be obtained by completing training assignments.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_05": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #5\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_06": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #6\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_06": "You're here, which means you have successfully collected information about the location of titan ore. If you haven't done so yet, open the cargo hold of your robot, right-click on the geoscan results and upload them onto your map.\r\n\r\nThe result should show an area that holds some titan ore. Now you need to go out there and extract some. If you reach the designated position on the terrain, lock a ground tile then activate your miner modules on it.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended to equip two miner modules for better efficiency. You will also need to put the titan ore miner charges that you received in your last assignment from your 'Private storage' to your robot's cargo hold or directly into your miner modules.\r\n\r\n[b]Come back for your next assignment when you're done![/b]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_ics_stage_03": "SynSec container [ICS tutorial assignment / File #3-b]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_asi_stage_03": "SynSec container [Asintec tutorial assignment / File #3-b]\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_07": "Knowing your enemy is half the battle won. It is advisable to have a look at the equipment of enemy robots before engaging them. To do so you will need to use a special tool, a so-called 'chassis scanner'.\r\n\r\nEquip the enclosed chassis scanner onto your robot, approach the marked enemy, lock it as a target and activate the chassis scanner.\r\n\r\n[b]There will be additional tutorial assignments waiting for you when you come back.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_07": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #7\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_08": "We think you are trained enough to deal with elite drones. Equip all the weapons you have, load as much ammunition as you can and hunt down the targets.\r\n\r\nIt is advised to bring an armor repairer to fix the damage the enemies will cause during the battle.\r\n\r\n[b]Come back for the next tutorial assignment when you're done.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_05": "You will certainly meet geology assignments during your career. This one is a training of revealing underground minerals.\r\n\r\nFirst, [b]you need to equip a geoscanner[/b] onto your robot if you don't have one equipped already. In your last assignment you have been given geoscanner charges for titan ore. They should be in your 'Private storage', so go ahead and put the charges into your activated robot's cargo hold.\r\n\r\nAfter you deploy onto the terrain, you will have to load the appropriate charges into the geoscanner,  reach the marked area and activate it.\r\n\r\n[b]If you succeed, come back for the 6th file![/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_08": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #8\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_09": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #9\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_asi_stage_01": "Asintec tutorial assignment / File #1\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_09": "The next assignment will be a combination of destroying enemy robots and delivering important packages.\r\n\r\nWe have received reliable information about alien robots holding valuable information. Your task is to destroy the robots, open their cargo hold and bring back the data consoles you find there.\r\n\r\n[b]Come back for another assignment when you're done.[/b]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_tm_stage_10_1": "Data console [Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment  / File #9-a]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_tm_stage_10_2": "Data console [Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment  / File #9-b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tutorial_tm_stage_10": "Truhold-Markson tutorial assignment / File #10\n  ",
  "missiontype_tutorial_stage_10": "This is going to be your hardest challenge so far. Your targets are regular warriors of the alien species. Their enforced hull and advanced weaponry will test your skills.\r\n\r\nRemember to equip the most advanced weapons you currently own. If you are taking too much damage, retreat to a safer spot and repair your robot. In case all your robots are destroyed, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new Arkhe for free. The reward, a brand new specialized light robot should also motivate you.\r\n\r\n[b]After you've finished this, come back to this terminal! Corporations of Perpetuum offer level 0 assignments especially for rookie Agents. Also, you can jump into the social part of Perpetuum by opening the detailed recruitment page to find an employer.[/b]\r\n\r\nGood luck Agent!\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_ics_stage_10_1": "Data console [ICS tutorial assignment  / File #9-a]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tutorial_ics_stage_10_2": "Data console [ICS tutorial assignment  / File #9-b]\n  ",
