  "def_named_blob_emission_modulator_desc": "'''Only one interference module can be equipped at a time.'''\r\n\r\n[[Help:Interference|Interference]] modules are the primary components of the tactical interference emission system. When activating this module deploys a small emitter unit onto the terrain, which emitter is generating interference waves to disturb enemy robots' sensors.\r\n\r\nThe module requires emitters to operate.\n  ",
