  "def_named_detection_modul_desc": "'''Only one signal detector can be equipped at a time.'''\r\n\r\nDetector modules enhance the default signal detection value of the robot. An expanded detection capability will help your robot to detect other robots from a greater distance.\r\n\r\nFor further details see [[Help:Signal_detection_and_masking|help]].\n  ",
