  "def_named_stealth_modul_desc": "'''Only one signal masker can be equipped at a time.'''\r\n\r\nMaskers help you to hide your robots by generating and emitting noise to the surrounding area. The module actually enhances the default masking value of your robot by a certain percentage.\r\n\r\nFor additional details see [[Help:Signal_detection_and_masking|help]].\n  ",
