  "def_plant_seed_electroplant_desc": "Bringing together organic and machine - the brand new generation of plant breeding technology, the organic incubator is a combination of the plant seed and a feeder device that constantly provides nutriments for the sprig.\r\n\r\nIn order to grow this plant, you need to deploy the incubator on the terrain on an appropriate tile. For planting hints check [[Help:Harvesting|help]].\n  ",
  "def_electroplant_fruit_desc": "Versatile material extruded from the Noralgis organic incubator. Noralgis is an essential component of '''Briochit'''.\n  ",
