  "def_artifact_a_medium_armor_repairer_desc": "'''This item once belonged to the mysterious Niani civilization. The only way to obtain Niani items is to [[Help:Geoscanning|search for artifacts]].'''\r\n\r\nRepairers help you restore the armor condition right on the battlefield. This process is executed by nanobots designed for the recovery of armor structure.\n  ",
