  "def_artifact_damaged_resistant_plating": "Flawed universal armor\n  ",
  "def_artifact_a_resistant_plating_desc": "'''This item once belonged to the mysterious Niani civilization. The only way to obtain Niani items is to [[Help:Geoscanning|search for artifacts]].'''\r\n\r\nThe universal armor coatings provides some defense against all varieties of [[Help:Weapons_and_ammo|damage types]], but they are incapable of the enhanced defense that a specialized defense can provide.\n  ",
