  "def_artifact_a_small_energy_neutralizer_desc": "'''This item once belonged to the mysterious Niani civilization. The only way to obtain Niani items is to [[Help:Geoscanning|search for artifacts]].'''\r\n\r\nA static, ionized field generated by the module depletes all the energy from the nearby, targeted accumulators - including yours!\n  ",
