  "def_artifact_a_small_core_battery": "Niani small auxiliary accumulator\n  ",
  "def_artifact_a_small_core_battery_desc": "'''This item once belonged to the mysterious Niani civilization. The only way to obtain Niani items is to [[Help:Geoscanning|search for artifacts]].'''\r\n\r\nThe storage capacity of the built-in accumulators can be further expanded with additional energy storage cells. This module raises total accumulator capacity by {%core_max%}.\n  ",
