  "def_artifact_damaged_small_laser": "Flawed light HCL laser\n  ",
  "def_artifact_damaged_small_laser_desc": "'''Long ranged laser'''\r\n\r\nConcentrated energy beams damage hulls mainly with thermal damage. Since these beams cannot be distracted by anything, lasers are ideal for distant targets. The laser-based combat style is preferred by Thelodica Clan.\n  ",
  "def_artifact_a_small_laser": "Niani light HCL laser\n  ",
