  "def_artifact_damaged_rocket_launcher": "Flawed light missile launcher\n  ",
  "def_artifact_damaged_rocket_launcher_desc": "Ballistic missiles have been a well known weapon type in Terran warfare. Pelistal innovation in warhead and propellant design make missiles an outstanding primary strike weapons platform on Nia.\n  ",
