  "missiontype_onlykill_level00_desc": "[b]Beginner assignment.[/b]\r\n\r\nWe want you to get used to the situation on Nia as soon as possible, so you need to accomplish a simple patrolling task for us. The points are marked on the map, you just need to approach them and we will show you the next one.\r\n\r\nOh yes, one more thing. It may happen that you need to destroy some alien native robots. It probably won't be difficult for you, but it is advised to bring the following equipment with you:\r\n\r\n* At least one weapon module of your choice\r\n* Ammunition to this weapon, at least 200 pieces\r\n* Armor repairer module in order to fix any damages on your robot\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tm_s_level00_003": "SynSec container [Truhold-Markson logistics rookie assignment / File #3]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_ics_s_level00_003": "SynSec container [ICS logistics rookie assignment / File #3]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_asi_s_level00_003": "SynSec container [Asintec logistics rookie assignment / File #3]\n  ",
  "missiontype_courier_level00_desc": "[b]Beginner assignment.[/b]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you will have to perform a basic transportation.\r\n\r\nThe SynSec container you are about to carry will now be transferred to your '''Private storage'''. First, put this container into the cargo of the robot you will use. Activate this robot, deploy onto the terrain and use the assignment map to navigate to the marked terminal.\r\n\r\nAfter you've entered the terminal, press on '''Deliver''' to complete the assignment.\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_tm_s_level00_001": "SynSec container [Truhold-Markson logistics rookie assignment / File #1]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_ics_s_level00_001": "SynSec container [ICS logistics rookie assignment / File #1]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_delivery_asi_s_level00_001": "SynSec container [Asintec logistics rookie assignment / File #1]\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_material_level00_desc": "[b]Beginner assignment.[/b]\r\n\r\nYou can help us to expand our current mineral map of Nia. Please approach the marked location and perform some imentium scans. Recommended equipment:\r\n\r\n* Geoscanner of your choice\r\n* Area-based geoscanner charge for imentium, 20 pieces\n  ",
  "missiontype_mining_level00_stermonit_desc": "[b]Beginner assignment.[/b]\r\n\r\nAh, your first steps to become a professional miner on Nia. We want you to exploit some stermonit for us on the marked location after you've reached the patrol points we have marked for you. Recommended equipment:\r\n\r\n* At least a miner module of your choice\r\n* Miner charge for stermonit, 50 pieces\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_level00_desc": "[b]Beginner assignment.[/b]\r\n\r\nIn this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. You don't have to destroy your targets, we only need scan results. Recommended equipment:\r\n\r\n* Chassis scanner of your choice\n  ",
