  "missiontype_retrieve_desc": "You need to retrieve a package for us, but it's heavily guarded. You might need to recruit a squad if you wish to succeed. Also, this package might exceed a regular robot's cargo hold, you should also bring a robot specialized in transportation as well to bring the target item back.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scanandloot_desc": "Your primary task is to create some images of the target robots, so you will need a chassis scanner for this assignment. The data you collect about them is of great importance to our troops. And while you're there, get rid of those junks, will you? Also, bring back their data consoles for a decent sum of NIC.\n  ",
  "missiontype_mining_desc": "In order to rev up the Nian economy, the Syndicate provides financial support to every Agent who is willing to exploit raw materials. You should equip an industrial robot with several miner modules, and a large portion of the appropriate miner charges. Dig out the minerals and you get the reward.\n  ",
  "missiontype_scan_robot_desc": "In this assignment, you're asked to provide useful information about the enemy life form. The only thing we ask you is to [b]equip a chassis scanner[/b] of your choice, approach the targets and create some images of them.\n  ",
