  "characterselect_reset_info": "[b]Account reset[/b] [color=#9da6a6]is an opportunity to start anew. If you feel that you used up your available EP for the wrong extensions, and think that the development of your characters is full of mistakes, you can do a reset. This will[/color] free up all the EP [color=#9da6a6]you have spent on your characters, so you can use them again on new characters.\r\n\r\nAccount reset comes with a price though,[/color] [color=#ffde00]make sure it's worth it![/color]\r\n\r\n[color=#9da6a6]- You can only perform a reset when you delete all your characters. This means[/color] [color=#ffde00]you will lose all relation rates, wealth and items on them.[/color] [color=#9da6a6](The EP used for character deletion will be reimbursed when you do a reset.)\r\n- The first reset on every account is for free, without a time limit, but every subsequent reset will put[/color] [color=#ffde00]20% of your [b]actual[/b] total accumulated EP into a cumulative penalty pool.[/color] [color=#ff3600]EP penalty can't be refunded![/color]\r\n\r\n[b]Your current status:[/b]\r\n\r\nTotal accumulated EP: [color=#00deff][b]{%EP%}[/b][/color]\r\n\r\nResets done so far: [color=#ffde00][b]{%COUNT%}[/b][/color] [color=#9da6a6]({%PENALTYTOTAL%} total EP lost to penalties)[/color]\r\n\r\nAvailable EP after next reset: [color=#48ff00][b]{%RESULTINGEP%}[/b][/color] [color=#ff3600]([b]-{%PENALTY%}[/b] EP penalty)[/color]\r\n\r\n[color=#ffde00]If you wish to perform an account reset, delete all your characters. The account reset button will become available here at the character selection screen, when you don't have any characters.[/color]\n  ",
