  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level01_exp3_01": "The teleport system we're currently using also functions as a global firewall, filtering incoming enemy spywares. As every efficient security system, it has its own, independent power supply, that's operated by emergency accumulators. Your task is to deliver the enclosed containers to the security system's access points and submit them. The station will automatically install the new accumulators. Since it's considered a safe routine job, you shouldn't expect significant enemy activity.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_defaultname_research": "Create {%QUANTITY%} {%DEFINITION%} by reverse engineering\n  ",
