  "unstack_volumeofelements": "Volume:\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ss_level01_exp3_01": "The teleport system we're currently using also functions as a global firewall, filtering incoming enemy spywares. As every efficient security system, it has its own, independent power supply, that's operated by emergency accumulators. Your task is to deliver the enclosed containers to the security system's access points and submit them. The station will automatically install the new accumulators. Since it's considered a safe routine job, you shouldn't expect significant enemy activity.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ss_level01_exp3_01": "The teleport system we're currently using also functions as a global firewall, filtering incoming enemy spywares. As every efficient security system, it has its own, independent power supply, that's operated by emergency accumulators. Your task is to deliver the enclosed containers to the security system's access points and submit them. The station will automatically install the new accumulators. Since it's considered a safe routine job, you shouldn't expect significant enemy activity.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level01_exp3_02": "Not long ago we lost contact with one of our transmitter stations, risking many terabytes of satellite reconnaissance data. The most likely presumption is that alien forces are blocking the communication between HQ and that station.\r\n\r\nYour first task will be to override the system manually using the interface. When you're done with that, access the station's database and grab the memory storage. Oh, and one other thing - the aliens might still be there. You don't need to destroy them; we're just after the data. Hurry up!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ss_level01_exp3_02": "Not long ago we lost contact with one of our transmitter stations, risking many terabytes of satellite reconnaissance data. The most likely presumption is that alien forces are blocking the communication between HQ and that station.\r\n\r\nYour first task will be to override the system manually using the interface. When you're done with that, access the station's database and grab the memory storage. Oh, and one other thing - the aliens might still be there. You don't need to destroy them; we're just after the data. Hurry up!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ss_level01_exp3_02": "Not long ago we lost contact with one of our transmitter stations, risking many terabytes of satellite reconnaissance data. The most likely presumption is that alien forces are blocking the communication between HQ and that station.\r\n\r\nYour first task will be to override the system manually using the interface. When you're done with that, access the station's database and grab the memory storage. Oh, and one other thing - the aliens might still be there. You don't need to destroy them; we're just after the data. Hurry up!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level01_exp3_03": "As a security protocol, all the passwords are changed from time to time on our communication system's terminals. Obviously, this process cannot be done via the possibly vulnerable SyncOS network, so the safe solution is to overwrite the passwords manually at the terminals.\r\n\r\nThe enclosed data has a digital fingerprint which only the terminal computers can process. Bring this item to the marked point, and insert the information into the communicational terminal. Since the data you're carrying is both encrypted and valuable, there's no guarantee that you won't encounter any enemies on your way there.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ss_level01_exp3_03": "As a security protocol, all the passwords are changed from time to time on our communication system's terminals. Obviously, this process cannot be done via the possibly vulnerable SyncOS network, so the safe solution is to overwrite the passwords manually at the terminals.\r\n\r\nThe enclosed data has a digital fingerprint which only the terminal computers can process. Bring this item to the marked point, and insert the information into the communicational terminal. Since the data you're carrying is both encrypted and valuable, there's no guarantee that you won't encounter any enemies on your way there.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ss_level01_exp3_03": "As a security protocol, all the passwords are changed from time to time on our communication system's terminals. Obviously, this process cannot be done via the possibly vulnerable SyncOS network, so the safe solution is to overwrite the passwords manually at the terminals.\r\n\r\nThe enclosed data has a digital fingerprint which only the terminal computers can process. Bring this item to the marked point, and insert the information into the communicational terminal. Since the data you're carrying is both encrypted and valuable, there's no guarantee that you won't encounter any enemies on your way there.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_01_target01": "Enemy forces spotted, take them out!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_01_target03": "They're ahead of us, follow the trail to the stolen manifest!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_01_target04": "Get back the Syndicate manifest before they upload it!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_01_target05": "Kill the infiltrators, show no mercy.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_01_target06": "Insert the data into the interface driver to destroy it.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level01_exp3_01": "Here's a particularly important assignment: one of our technicians tried to send the manifest of the zone's manufacturing statement through an unsafe communication channel. Needless to say, it is important that this information (our war stocks) not get into the wrong hands - especially that of those alien junkheaps. The worst appears to have occurred, however - the information never reached our communication station. We believe that this area was where infiltrators managed to download the manifest.\r\n\r\nYour task is simple: go to the terminal, and look for any clues that might lead to the thieves. If you can, prevent them from uploading the information to their central hub. This is a hunting expedition, Agent, so go well-armed. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level01_exp3_01": "Here's a particularly important assignment: one of our technicians tried to send the manifest of the zone's manufacturing statement through an unsafe communication channel. Needless to say, it is important that this information (our war stocks) not get into the wrong hands - especially that of those alien junkheaps. The worst appears to have occurred, however - the information never reached our communication station. We believe that this area was where infiltrators managed to download the manifest.\r\n\r\nYour task is simple: go to the terminal, and look for any clues that might lead to the thieves. If you can, prevent them from uploading the information to their central hub. This is a hunting expedition, Agent, so go well-armed. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level01_exp3_01": "Here's a particularly important assignment: one of our technicians tried to send the manifest of the zone's manufacturing statement through an unsafe communication channel. Needless to say, it is important that this information (our war stocks) not get into the wrong hands - especially that of those alien junkheaps. The worst appears to have occurred, however - the information never reached our communication station. We believe that this area was where infiltrators managed to download the manifest.\r\n\r\nYour task is simple: go to the terminal, and look for any clues that might lead to the thieves. If you can, prevent them from uploading the information to their central hub. This is a hunting expedition, Agent, so go well-armed. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level01_exp3_02": "We need your help here. One of our experimental weapon's calibration template is missing, and it was replaced with a fake one, before we could make a security copy of it. The identity of the saboteur is unknown, although we can determine the approximate location of this data.\r\n\r\nTravel to one of our transferring stations, activate the interface, and after you've found the location of the data, retrieve it. Don't go unarmed.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level01_exp3_02": "We need your help here. One of our experimental weapon's calibration template is missing, and it was replaced with a fake one, before we could make a security copy of it. The identity of the saboteur is unknown, although we can determine the approximate location of this data.\r\n\r\nTravel to one of our transferring stations, activate the interface, and after you've found the location of the data, retrieve it. Don't go unarmed.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level01_exp3_02": "We need your help here. One of our experimental weapon's calibration template is missing, and it was replaced with a fake one, before we could make a security copy of it. The identity of the saboteur is unknown, although we can determine the approximate location of this data.\r\n\r\nTravel to one of our transferring stations, activate the interface, and after you've found the location of the data, retrieve it. Don't go unarmed.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_02_target02": "Use the interface to find the stolen data.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_02_target03": "Follow the trail.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_02_target04": "Retrieve the stolen data!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_02_target05": "Excellent work, now bring back that thing!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target02": "Good, now use the interface.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target03": "Excellent, now get to the second grid point.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target04": "Use the interface.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target05": "Two to go, now to the third locator.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target06": "Use the interface.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target07": "Wait a second, a transmitter is missing, kill the thieves and get it back!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_03_target09": "Excellent job! Now insert the transmitter into the socket.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level01_exp3_03": "During this regular maintaining operation you will need to perform a little testing. Switch off, then reactivate the three grid switches of our anti-intruder radar system. Your task is simple: visit each grid of the system, and activate the interface you find there.\r\n\r\nThis is supposed to be a routine assignment, but who knows what might happen? You should bring some weapons with yourself.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level01_exp3_03": "During this regular maintaining operation you will need to perform a little testing. Switch off, then reactivate the three grid switches of our anti-intruder radar system. Your task is simple: visit each grid of the system, and activate the interface you find there.\r\n\r\nThis is supposed to be a routine assignment, but who knows what might happen? You should bring some weapons with yourself.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level01_exp3_03": "During this regular maintaining operation you will need to perform a little testing. Switch off, then reactivate the three grid switches of our anti-intruder radar system. Your task is simple: visit each grid of the system, and activate the interface you find there.\r\n\r\nThis is supposed to be a routine assignment, but who knows what might happen? You should bring some weapons with yourself.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level01_exp3_04": "Due to recent enemy activities, our miners are facing constant threat, even on inner zones. Your task will be to deliver the enclosed container to the miners' storage (marked on your map). Don't forget to arm yourself before deployment.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level01_exp3_04": "Due to recent enemy activities, our miners are facing constant threat, even on inner zones. Your task will be to deliver the enclosed container to the miners' depot (marked on your map). Don't forget to arm yourself before deployment.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level01_exp3_04": "Due to recent enemy activities, our miners are facing constant threat, even on inner zones. Your task will be to deliver the enclosed container to the miners' depot (marked on your map). Don't forget to arm yourself before deployment.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_04_target02": "Some of the supplies are gone! Check a nearby depot.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_04_target03": "Thieves, kill them!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_04_target04": "Get the supplies from the marked container.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_04_target05": "Excellent, now bring it back.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_05_target02": "Excellent, now kill those aliens!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_05_target03": "Great work, but it seems that the officer is somewhere else.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level01_exp3_05": "Reconnaissance reports tell about a small alien strike force, led by an experienced officer. We have to stop them before they could inflict any damage to our facilities. Kill some of those intruders, but your primary task is to take out that officer. We cannot afford to show weakness, soldier.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level01_exp3_05": "Reconnaissance reports tell about a small alien strike force, led by an experienced officer. We have to stop them before they could inflict any damage to our facilities. Kill some of those intruders, but your primary task is to take out that officer. We cannot afford to show weakness, soldier.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level01_exp3_05": "Reconnaissance reports tell about a small alien strike force, led by an experienced officer. We have to stop them before they could inflict any damage to our facilities. Kill some of those intruders, but your primary task is to take out that officer. We cannot afford to show weakness, soldier.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level01_exp3_06": "We need your help here. We're getting strange signals from some of our transmitter stations, and we have already lost connection with one of them. Travel to the marked station, and use its interface to find the cause of this dropout. This is probably nothing more than a malfunction, but a couple of equipped guns will not hurt.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level01_exp3_06": "We need your help here. We're getting strange signals from some of our transmitter stations, and we have already lost connection with one of them. Travel to the marked station, and use its interface to find the cause of this dropout. This is probably nothing more than a malfunction, but a couple of equipped guns will not hurt.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_06_target02": "Now use the interface.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_06_target03": "Strange, it seems like a hacking attempt. Go and check out the next station!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_06_target04": "Saboteurs! Kill them and get their container!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level01_exp3_06_target06": "Excellent job, Agent! Bring us that container.\n  ",
  "missiontype_production": "Production\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level01_exp3_01": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find ilmenite, you will need to mine common titan ore. Obviously, the more titan ore you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon ilmenite. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of ilmenite we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, titan ore) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
