  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level01_exp3_03": "While harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level01_exp3_03": "While harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level01_exp3_03": "While harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find Prismorum, you will need to harvest common Prismocitae. Obviously, the more Prismocitae you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon Prismorum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of Prismorum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, Prismocitae) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level01_exp3_01_target01": "Excellent, now deliver the materials.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level01_exp3_02_target01": "Excellent, now deliver the materials.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level01_exp3_03_target01": "Excellent, now deliver the materials.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level01_exp3_06_target02": "Good, now use your chassis scanner.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level01_exp3_06_target03": "We need that container you've found.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level01_exp3_06_target04": "Brilliant, bring here that container!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level01_exp3_06": "A small mining group of the mysterious Industrial Trust is performing excavations nearby. We need you to survey their gear with a chassis scanner, and bring in every useful container you find there. [b]Don't forget to equip a chassis scanner and some weapons before deployment![/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level01_exp3_06": "A small mining group of the mysterious Industrial Trust is performing excavations nearby. We need you to survey their gear with a chassis scanner, and bring in every useful container you find there. [b]Don't forget to equip a chassis scanner and some weapons before deployment![/b]\n  ",
