  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level02_exp3_01": "[i]The Truhold-Markson development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. Penntyte's solution, Operation Techolique, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find equudium, you will need to mine common liquizit. Obviously, the more liquizit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon equudium. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of equudium we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, liquizit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level02_exp3_01": "[i]The ICS development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. DFI's solution, Operation Meteora, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find equudium, you will need to mine common liquizit. Obviously, the more liquizit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon equudium. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of equudium we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, liquizit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level02_exp3_01": "[i]The Asintec development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. Seiguchi's solution, Operation Caucasus, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find equudium, you will need to mine common liquizit. Obviously, the more liquizit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon equudium. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of equudium we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, liquizit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "spark_syndicate_nic_fitboost": "Syn-tec GenII/EvR \"Inflex\"\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level02_exp3_01_target01": "Excellent job, Agent! Now deliver the minerals.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level02_exp3_02": "[i]The Truhold-Markson development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. Penntyte's solution, Operation Techolique, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find carcytum, you will need to mine common imentium. Obviously, the more imentium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon carcytum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of carcytum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, imentium) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level02_exp3_02": "[i]The ICS development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. DFI's solution, Operation Meteora, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find opacit, you will need to mine common stermonit. Obviously, the more stermonit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon opacit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of opacit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, stermonit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level02_exp3_02": "[i]The Asintec development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. Seiguchi's solution, Operation Caucasus, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find opacit, you will need to mine common stermonit. Obviously, the more stermonit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon opacit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of opacit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, stermonit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ii_level02_exp3_02_target01": "Good! Now bring that back.\n  ",
