  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_03_target02": "Now use the interface to find the malware.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_03_target03": "You've found it! Grab the console that contains the virus.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_03_target04": "Now follow the troublemakers.\n  ",
