  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level02_exp3_04": "[i]UASD is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Tornado\" to counteract Pelistal Empire's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nJust as we have ace Agents, there are ace Nians. We’ve recently gotten a possible intelligence suggestion as to the whereabouts of one of their aces, and we want to track it down before it causes any more damage.\r\n\r\nHead to the marked location and start investigating. We’re not sure about the source of the intelligence, so be prepared for all contingencies: bring weaponry, a geoscanner, and enough artifact scanning charges to do some looking around if need be.\n  ",
