  "def_missionitem_asi_ww_level02_exp3_08_t03": "Data console [Cyrus VIII/2]\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_08_target04": "Excellent, now insert the first data package into their \"sanctum\".\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_08_target05": "Now insert the second one.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_08_target06": "There he is, kill him!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level02_exp3_06": "[i]UASD is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Tornado\" to counteract Pelistal Empire's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nA combat strike by our 29th battalion against a guerilla outpost was successful, forcing the Nians to retreat. Unfortunately, we haven’t been able to analyze the wreckage yet, and it’s likely that the guerillas will return and retrieve or destroy the containers to prevent us from doing so.\r\n\r\nYour job is to go to the outpost, eliminate any guerillas you might find, and bring back the container with the logs. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level02_exp3_06": "[i]DFD is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Bellerophon\" to counteract Nuimqol Union's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nA combat strike by our 29th battalion against a guerilla outpost was successful, forcing the Nians to retreat. Unfortunately, we haven’t been able to analyze the wreckage yet, and it’s likely that the guerillas will return and retrieve or destroy the containers to prevent us from doing so.\r\n\r\nYour job is to go to the outpost, eliminate any guerillas you might find, and bring back the container with the logs. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level02_exp3_06": "[i]Matsuda is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Cyrus\" to counteract Thelodica Clan's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nA combat strike by our 29th battalion against a guerilla outpost was successful, forcing the Nians to retreat. Unfortunately, we haven’t been able to analyze the wreckage yet, and it’s likely that the guerillas will return and retrieve or destroy the containers to prevent us from doing so.\r\n\r\nYour job is to go to the outpost, eliminate any guerillas you might find, and bring back the container with the logs. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_06_target02": "There they are, shoot them!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_06_target03": "Now open the container and get the plans.\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_tm_ww_level02_exp3_06_t03": "SynSec container [Tornado VI]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_ics_ww_level02_exp3_06_t03": "SynSec container [Bellerophon VI]\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_asi_ww_level02_exp3_06_t03": "SynSec container [Cyrus VI]\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_06_target04": "Now bring it back, Agent.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level02_exp3_09": "[i]UASD is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Tornado\" to counteract Pelistal Empire's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nAgent, we expect this mission to be very challenging. A guerilla infiltration effort by the Nians has managed to gain control over one of our trading ports, and satellite imaging has detected a large energy pulse. We think they’re teleporting large quantities of war materials into the area. Your overall objective is to take these materials for our use.\r\n\r\nObviously, it’s not going to be quite that simple. First, you’ll need to eliminate the scouting squad that has established a perimeter in the area, in order to get the scan values needed to locate their commander. Once you have done so, your [b]artifact scanner[/b] should be able to locate him. Pursue and eliminate him, and take his access key.\r\n\r\nThe key should give you access to the container they’re using to store the war materials, completing your mission. Move swiftly and with force, Agent. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ww_level02_exp3_09": "[i]DFD is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Bellerophon\" to counteract Nuimqol Union's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nAgent, we expect this mission to be very challenging. A guerilla infiltration effort by the Nians has managed to gain control over one of our trading ports, and satellite imaging has detected a large energy pulse. We think they’re teleporting large quantities of war materials into the area. Your overall objective is to take these materials for our use.\r\n\r\nObviously, it’s not going to be quite that simple. First, you’ll need to eliminate the scouting squad that has established a perimeter in the area, in order to get the scan values needed to locate their commander. Once you have done so, your [b]artifact scanner[/b] should be able to locate him. Pursue and eliminate him, and take his access key.\r\n\r\nThe key should give you access to the container they’re using to store the war materials, completing your mission. Move swiftly and with force, Agent. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ww_level02_exp3_09": "[i]Matsuda is carrying out a comprehensive and effective offensive under the codename \"Operation Cyrus\" to counteract Thelodica Clan's intensifying guerilla activities.[/i]\r\n\r\nAgent, we expect this mission to be very challenging. A guerilla infiltration effort by the Nians has managed to gain control over one of our trading ports, and satellite imaging has detected a large energy pulse. We think they’re teleporting large quantities of war materials into the area. Your overall objective is to take these materials for our use.\r\n\r\nObviously, it’s not going to be quite that simple. First, you’ll need to eliminate the scouting squad that has established a perimeter in the area, in order to get the scan values needed to locate their commander. Once you have done so, your [b]artifact scanner[/b] should be able to locate him. Pursue and eliminate him, and take his access key.\r\n\r\nThe key should give you access to the container they’re using to store the war materials, completing your mission. Move swiftly and with force, Agent. Good luck.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_09_target02": "Here's the scout squadron. Kill them to get to the captain.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_09_target03": "They've signalled the commander, access the console to traceroute him!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_09_target04": "Good, now you can search for him with your artifact scanner.\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_09_target05": "Bodyguards? You can deal with them!\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_09_target06": "Now you can use the key to fetch that cargo.\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_tm_ww_level02_exp3_09_t05": "Data console [Tornado IX]\n  ",
  "missiontarget_activate_ww_level02_exp3_09_target07": "There it is, fetch the container.\n  ",
