  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level02_exp3_05": "[i]The Truhold-Markson development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. Penntyte's solution, Operation Techolique, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis zone served as an important military stronghold for the Nians. Unfortunately, we still aren't certain how communication between Nian groups is being maintained without radio waves - it's possible the remaining telecom stations can shed some light on this. Go to the listed telecom locations, pull out any useful items you may find, and reverse engineer them.\r\n\r\n[b]You will need 3 decoders to reverse engineer the target items.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level02_exp3_05": "[i]The ICS development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. DFI's solution, Operation Meteora, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis zone served as an important military stronghold for the Nians. Unfortunately, we still aren't certain how communication between Nian groups is being maintained without radio waves - it's possible the remaining telecom stations can shed some light on this. Go to the listed telecom locations, pull out any useful items you may find, and reverse engineer them.\r\n\r\n[b]You will need 3 decoders to reverse engineer the target items.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level02_exp3_05": "[i]The Asintec development bureau has reported that the invaded zones are in need of urgent infrastructural renovation. Seiguchi's solution, Operation Caucasus, relies on experienced industry experts handling its missions.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis zone served as an important military stronghold for the Nians. Unfortunately, we still aren't certain how communication between Nian groups is being maintained without radio waves - it's possible the remaining telecom stations can shed some light on this. Go to the listed telecom locations, pull out any useful items you may find, and reverse engineer them.\r\n\r\n[b]You will need 3 decoders to reverse engineer the target items.[/b]\n  ",
