  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level02_exp3_02": "[i]Operation Techolique relies heavily on fast and efficient logistics. Consequently, Operation Foxtrott offers job opportunities for experienced logistics workers such as yourself.[/i]\r\n\r\nAs you're aware, Nian espionage is on the rise lately, and their sabotage has been causing...difficulties. We're upgrading and reinforcing some of our comlink towers in response - we need you to install a new emergency accumulator, and replace the current database with a new one.\n  ",
