  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level02_exp3_05": "[i]Operation Techolique relies heavily on fast and efficient logistics. Consequently, Operation Foxtrott offers job opportunities for experienced logistics workers such as yourself.[/i]\r\n\r\nWe need you to take care of something. For whatever reason, we can't ping the memory rods on several commercial comlink towers. That means important information can't be synchronized, and we're being forced to use a much more vulnerable alternative. We need this comlink network restored as soon as possible - bring back the damaged memory rods so we can figure out what's going on.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ss_level02_exp3_05": "[i]Operation Meteora relies heavily on fast and efficient logistics. Consequently, Operation Amsterdam offers job opportunities for experienced logistics workers such as yourself.[/i]\r\n\r\nWe need you to take care of something. For whatever reason, we can't ping the memory rods on several commercial comlink towers. That means important information can't be synchronized, and we're being forced to use a much more vulnerable alternative. We need this comlink network restored as soon as possible - bring back the damaged memory rods so we can figure out what's going on.\n  ",
