  "def_nuimqol1_damage_mod_railgun_desc": "'''This is a service item of the Nuimqol Sapphire Vanguards. You can only obtain service items by destroying and looting Vanguard members. There is no way to manufacture them.'''\r\n\r\nAuxiliary magnetic coils in this module cause more powerful discharges - generating greater damage and shorter cycle time on magnetic weapons by applying the module on your robot.\n  ",
