  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level03_exp3_01": "It appears that General Melain’s recent sabotage campaign against the Nians has inspired them to try the same on us. Head out to the location on your map; you’ll find some badly polluted soil where we had hoped to set up some noralgis cultivation. Activate the soil analysis tools that are still there and you ought to be able to find their pollutants pretty quickly. Grab it  and bring it to the nearby minilab so we can start figuring out how to counter whatever they’ve put into the soil.\r\n\r\nPack for a fight, though - it’s reasonable to expect the Nians may be looking to ambush whoever comes to fix what they’ve broken. [b]Also, apart from a decent weaponry, don't forget to bring a geoscanner with plenty of artifact scanner charges![/b]\n  ",
  "entityinfo_stability": "Stability\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level03_exp3_01": "An unfortunately successful Nian sabotage effort managed to sharply deplete our stocks of carcytum. While dealing with the security issue is not our problem, replacing what was lost is. Because we can’t be sure if any of the other materials currently on the market are contaminated in the same manner as the sabotage, we’ll need a fresh stock. Please bring the load back here when you’ve completed the acquisition.\r\n\r\n[i]To find carcytum, you will need to mine common imentium. Obviously, the more imentium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon carcytum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of carcytum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, imentium) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_01": "An unfortunately successful Nian sabotage effort managed to sharply deplete our stocks of carcytum. While dealing with the security issue is not our problem, replacing what was lost is. Because we can’t be sure if any of the other materials currently on the market are contaminated in the same manner as the sabotage, we’ll need a fresh stock. Please bring the load back here when you’ve completed the acquisition.\r\n\r\n[i]To find carcytum, you will need to mine common imentium. Obviously, the more imentium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon carcytum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of carcytum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, imentium) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level03_exp3_01": "An unfortunately successful Nian sabotage effort managed to sharply deplete our stocks of opacit. While dealing with the security issue is not our problem, replacing what was lost is. Because we can’t be sure if any of the other materials currently on the market are contaminated in the same manner as the sabotage, we’ll need a fresh stock. Please bring the load back here when you’ve completed the acquisition.\r\n\r\n[i]To find opacit, you will need to mine common stermonit. Obviously, the more stermonit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon opacit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of opacit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, stermonit) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
