  "missiondescription_tm_ww_level03_exp3_02": "Recently, the Nians have been getting a lot more crafty about our efforts to analyze their activities. They’ve started sending out scouting and raiding teams deliberately planted with false information to confuse our intelligence guys. That’s not a problem because the Nians aren’t that good at false plants yet, but more troublesome are the booby traps they’ve been putting on valid data cores. We’ve got a group that’s either got false info or trapped valid info moving past us quite soon, and we’d like you to eliminate them. After you do so, pull the data console out, and take it over to the nearby cargo-analysis tool. It should tell us what we’re dealing with; once it’s done, bring the data console back here.\n  ",
