  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_12": "Munitions expenditures are sharply up this month as a result of the defense effort in this area. While we weren’t anticipating such a drawdown on our vespersit stocks, there are ample amounts of Triandlus growing around here to compensate for it. Head out and start bringing in the indicated amount so we can get our stores back to optimal levels.\r\n\r\n[i]To find vespersit, you will need to harvest common triandlus. Obviously, the more triandlus you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon vespersit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of vespersit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, triandlus) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level03_exp3_12": "Munitions expenditures are sharply up this month as a result of the defense effort in this area. While we weren’t anticipating such a drawdown on our prismorum stocks, there are ample amounts of Prismocitae growing around here to compensate for it. Head out and start bringing in the indicated amount so we can get our stores back to optimal levels.\r\n\r\n[i]To find prismorum, you will need to harvest common Prismocitae. Obviously, the more Prismocitae you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon prismorum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of prismorum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, Prismocitae) you mine in that time are yours.[/i]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level03_exp3_12": "Munitions expenditures are sharply up this month as a result of the defense effort in this area. While we weren’t anticipating such a drawdown on our vespersit stocks, there are ample amounts of Triandlus growing around here to compensate for it. Head out and start bringing in the indicated amount so we can get our stores back to optimal levels.\r\n\r\n[i]To find vespersit, you will need to harvest common triandlus. Obviously, the more triandlus you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon vespersit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of vespersit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, triandlus) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_13": "For once the military and science boys got their heads together and let us know in advance that they’re going to have higher-than-normal needs for the upcoming campaign. As incredible as that may seem, we’re still going to encourage that behavior and take advantage of the advance warning. Please go out and gather up olyclin so that when their needs spike as predicted, we’ll be able to compensate for it immediately. \r\n\r\n[i]To find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
