  "missiondescription_asi_ii_level03_exp3_13": "For once the military and science boys got their heads together and let us know in advance that they’re going to have higher-than-normal needs for the upcoming campaign. As incredible as that may seem, we’re still going to encourage that behavior and take advantage of the advance warning. Please go out and gather up Prismorum so that when their needs spike as predicted, we’ll be able to compensate for it immediately. \r\n\r\n[i]To find Prismorum, you will need to harvest common Prismocitae. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon Prismorum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of Prismorum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, Prismocitae) you mine in that time is yours.[/i]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_04": "One nice thing about R&D here on Nia is that there’s no law against theft of another’s intellectual property. In fact, it’s downright encouraged! To that end, we’d like you to head out to this location - marked on your map - and snag an example of the latest Nian accumulator tech. \r\n\r\n[b]You’ll probably need an artifact scanner to dig it out of the mess.[/b] We’re pretty sure it’s unguarded, because we don’t think they know we’re aware of it. Reverse engineer it so we get an idea of what we’re working with, and then bring the template back to me. You, of course, will get all due credit for your efforts.\n  ",
