  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_07": "This is a pretty cut and dry job, Agent. We had a clumsy tech smash a pair of Calibration Templates we needed, and we’re under a bit of pressure, so we can’t go through the trouble of re-generating them right now. You, on the other hand, can. You’ll need to find copies of the object to reverse, obviously, but we just need the Calibration Templates - bring them back when you’ve got them ready.\n  ",
