  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_08": "We just need a quick hand on this one, Agent. Here are two copies of items we need reverse engineered so that we can put the schematics to use. You’ll need to supply your own decoders, but I’m sure you’ll agree the payout covers the cost. Please get that back to me as soon as possible.\n  ",
