  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_10": "We’re picking up an odd signature in this area on your map, Agent. We’d like you to head out there, and once you’ve arrived, scan down the artifact that’s causing the strange readings. Not only will this clear our radars - which will make the military folks quite happy - it will give us something to study and possibly use to return the radar-confusing favor to the Nians some day. Get moving.\n  ",
