  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level03_exp3_01": "Agent, we’d like you to use a bit of discretion on this next assignment. We have some highly sensitive material we need moved, but it’s very important that a) it be moved quietly, and b) it not fall into the wrong hands. The material has actually been divided into three sections previously to ensure security up to this point.\r\n\r\nHere’s a specific keycard you’ll need. Go to the first point labelled on your map. There, the keycard will be authorized so that the pickup locations will recognize you and dispense the materials you’ll need to carry. Once your keycard is authorized, move to each of the three locations and pick up your cargo. Then bring them all to a fourth location as swiftly and smoothly as possible. It is imperative that nothing go wrong here, Agent. Move without delay.\n  ",
