  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level03_exp3_02": "As you’re no doubt aware, Agent, we’ve been doing some pretty heavy testing on the Nian emergency beacons recently. We need your help with another of these tests today.\r\n\r\n[b]Bring a chassis scanner with you and head out into the field.[/b] There, you’ll be activating a series of three sensor platforms so we can get a triangulated reading on the Nian emergency beacon when you activate it. Oh. Did we not mention that part? After you’ve set up all three sensor platforms, you’ll be given the beacon and sent to a fourth location to activate it. It only makes sense - you’ll be out there anyway, right? We don’t think the Nian rescue team that arrives will be too dangerous. At least, we hope not for your sake - we’ll need you to scan the arriving Nian with that chassis scanner before you come back for payment. Good luck and get moving, Agent.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ss_level03_exp3_02": "As you’re no doubt aware, Agent, we’ve been doing some pretty heavy testing on the Nian emergency beacons recently. We need your help with another of these tests today.\r\n\r\n[b]Bring a chassis scanner with you and head out into the field.[/b] There, you’ll be activating a series of three sensor platforms so we can get a triangulated reading on the Nian emergency beacon when you activate it. Oh. Did we not mention that part? After you’ve set up all three sensor platforms, you’ll be given the beacon and sent to a fourth location to activate it. It only makes sense - you’ll be out there anyway, right? We don’t think the Nian rescue team that arrives will be too dangerous. At least, we hope not for your sake - we’ll need you to scan the arriving Nian with that chassis scanner before you come back for payment. Good luck and get moving, Agent.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_ss_level03_exp3_02": "As you’re no doubt aware, Agent, we’ve been doing some pretty heavy testing on the Nian emergency beacons recently. We need your help with another of these tests today.\r\n\r\n[b]Bring a chassis scanner with you and head out into the field.[/b] There, you’ll be activating a series of three sensor platforms so we can get a triangulated reading on the Nian emergency beacon when you activate it. Oh. Did we not mention that part? After you’ve set up all three sensor platforms, you’ll be given the beacon and sent to a fourth location to activate it. It only makes sense - you’ll be out there anyway, right? We don’t think the Nian rescue team that arrives will be too dangerous. At least, we hope not for your sake - we’ll need you to scan the arriving Nian with that chassis scanner before you come back for payment. Good luck and get moving, Agent.\n  ",
