  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level03_exp3_03": "Agent, we need some eyes on the ground right now. Something unusual is either taking place or just took place on the location we’re marking on your map.\r\n\r\n[b]Bring a geoscanner loaded with artifact probes[/b] so that you can figure out what went on once you finally arrive. If you find anything interesting, bring that object to our analysis station at the second location we’ll mark on your map. Something strange is going on, and we don’t like strange. Get moving.\n  ",
