  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level03_exp3_04": "Hey Agent, have you ever heard the old joke about someone being a “gopher?” You know, where their whole job is to “go for this” and “go for that?” No? Well, now you have. We need you to run out to the marked location on your map, toggle the security switch on the bin out there, and bring the contents back here as quickly as possible. Got that? Oh, and the package is huge, so you might want to bring a sequer or something in that category. Get moving, gopher.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ss_level03_exp3_04": "Hey Agent, have you ever heard the old joke about someone being a “gopher?” You know, where their whole job is to “go for this” and “go for that?” No? Well, now you have. We need you to run out to the marked location on your map, toggle the security switch on the bin out there, and bring the contents back here as quickly as possible. Got that? Oh, and the package is huge, so you might want to bring a sequer or something in that category. Get moving, gopher.\n  ",
