  "missiondescription_tm_ss_level03_exp3_05": "There’s a wealth of information hiding just under the surface of Nia, Agent, and your job today is to do some digging. [b]Grab your favorite geoscanner and a load of artifact charges[/b], and head out to these two locations marked on your map. We’re pretty sure there are artifacts at both locations, and we’d like you to scan them down, pick them up, and haul them back in to us. We’ll of course compensate you fairly for your time, regardless of the value of the artifact, whether it’s worthless or valuable. We wouldn’t want to be unfair. Get moving, Agent.\n  ",
