  "missiondescription_speci_anniversary": "Our research efforts in massive energy transmission, that might actually solve our home planet's energy crisis have unfortunately came to a halt. Syndicate scientists suggest that the ancient Niani technology might hold our breakthrough here.\r\n\r\nDuring this assignment you will search for an Ancient artifact that might contain precious Ancient data consoles. If you manage to collect at least 3 of them, we provide you one of the two available \"Niani A1\" sparks.\r\n\r\nTo unlock a spark, you need at least 3 data consoles. Consequently, to unlock one spark, you have to find an ancient data console on Hershfield, Tellesis and Shinjalar as well.\n  ",
