  "missiondescription_tm_ii_level03_exp3_09": "There’s a bit of a gold rush going on right now, Agent, except that in this case the “gold” is a series of Nian artifacts; we’ve recently unearthed an area where quite a few of them can be found. We need you to help make sure that our corporation is the one that comes away with the most.\r\n\r\nHere are three locations where we suspect artifacts can be found. Head out there, scan all three down, and bring them back. We’re expecting you to handle this promptly, Agent, so get moving.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_ii_level03_exp3_09": "There’s a bit of a gold rush going on right now, Agent, except that in this case the “gold” is a series of Nian artifacts; we’ve recently unearthed an area where quite a few of them can be found. We need you to help make sure that our corporation is the one that comes away with the most.\r\n\r\nHere are three locations where we suspect artifacts can be found. Head out there, scan all three down, and bring them back. We’re expecting you to handle this promptly, Agent, so get moving.\n  ",
