  "def_tm_mission_coin_desc": "Such tokens are issued by Truhold-Markson and can be obtained by completing [[Help:Missions|assignments]]. You can use these tokens at [[Help:Syndicate_Supplies|Syndicate Supplies]] to buy rare and valuable ammunition, charges, or items.\n  ",
