  "def_scarab_bot": "Scarab\n  ",
  "def_scarab_bot_desc": "'''Class:''' Heavy glider specialized in transportation\r\n\r\n'''Faction:''' Nian Industrial Trust\r\n\r\nThe Scarab represents an ominous new development for humanity. While the Industrial Trust's platform is no weapon of war - it is as fragile and easily squashed as the bug from which it takes its name - the Scarab represents a technology previously unknown: a mechanism allowing a massive Nian platform to leave the ground. Although it is unknown what other Nians possess this ability, the Scarab represents an alarming message: \"Humanity is not the only force capable of innovation on Nia.\"\n  ",
  "ext_glider_specialist": "Glider robot control\n  ",
  "ext_glider_specialist_desc": "'''5th level''' enables controlling of Heavy gliders\r\n\r\nIn addition, each level of the extension multiplies the bonuses of glider robots by the number of the level.\n  ",
