  "missiondescription_tm_w_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Proximity, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis one is a test of your courage, wether you're capable to take one's life and belongings as your contractor asks you to do. Try not to worry about that, you're killing aliens after all. Get to work, Agent!\r\n\r\nOh and one more thing: when you're done with the killing, get the consoles you find there.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Nebula, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis one is a test of your courage, wether you're capable to take one's life and belongings as your contractor asks you to do. Try not to worry about that, you're killing aliens after all. Get to work, Agent!\r\n\r\nOh and one more thing: when you're done with the killing, get the consoles you find there.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Optimum, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis one is a test of your courage, wether you're capable to take one's life and belongings as your contractor asks you to do. Try not to worry about that, you're killing aliens after all. Get to work, Agent!\r\n\r\nOh and one more thing: when you're done with the killing, get the consoles you find there.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_w_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Proximity, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis assignment might require good sneaking skills, as well as a couple of decent guns. [b]Equip a chassis scanner[/b] onto your robot, and scan the target objects, and when you're done, show them no mercy. Make haste, Agent!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_w_level00_exp3_03": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Proximity, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThe console we're looking for belongs to an unrevealed robot, we only know his approximate location. [b]Equip a geoscanner onto your robot, and buy some additional artifact scanner charges,[/b] and investigate the area we've marked on your map. In case you find him, kill him and take his console!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_w_level00_exp3_04": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Proximity, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThese aliens have quite decent security measures when it comes to protect valuable data: their resource log is divided into two separate key sequences - that means we need both to decode that. Kill the two marked squadrons and take both consoles.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Nebula, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis assignment might require good sneaking skills, as well as a couple of decent guns. [b]Equip a chassis scanner[/b] onto your robot, and scan the target objects, and when you're done, show them no mercy. Make haste, Agent!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Optimum, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis assignment might require good sneaking skills, as well as a couple of decent guns. [b]Equip a chassis scanner[/b] onto your robot, and scan the target objects, and when you're done, show them no mercy. Make haste, Agent!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_level00_exp3_03": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Nebula, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThe console we're looking for belongs to an unrevealed robot, we only know his approximate location. [b]Equip a geoscanner onto your robot, and buy some additional artifact scanner charges,[/b] and investigate the area we've marked on your map. In case you find him, kill him and take his console!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_level00_exp3_03": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Optimum, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThe console we're looking for belongs to an unrevealed robot, we only know his approximate location. [b]Equip a geoscanner onto your robot, and buy some additional artifact scanner charges,[/b] and investigate the area we've marked on your map. In case you find him, kill him and take his console!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_level00_exp3_04": "[i]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Nebula, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/i]\r\n\r\nThese aliens have quite decent security measures when it comes to protect valuable data: their resource log is divided into two separate key sequences - that means we need both to decode that. Kill the two marked squadrons and take both consoles.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_level00_exp3_04": "[b]Now that you have access to the combat assignments of Operation Optimum, it is a great opportunity for you to prove your skills. Avoid mistakes, and you might get access to assignments of higher levels.[/b]\r\n\r\nThese aliens have quite decent security measures when it comes to protect valuable data: their resource log is divided into two separate key sequences - that means we need both to decode that. Kill the two marked squadrons and take both consoles.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Operation Elephant is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Operation Elephant is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find ilmenite, you will need to mine common titan ore. Obviously, the more titan ore you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon ilmenite. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of ilmenite we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, titan ore) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level00_exp3_03": "[i]Operation Elephant is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nIt must be a piece of cake: we need you to create a mobile teleport accumulator, but first, gather all the requirements and components. Everything is marked on your map, just follow the orders and you will be ready in no time.\r\n\r\nDon't forget to give back the enclosed Calibration Template. To do so, you'll have to extract the CT from the factory line after the manufacturing process is done.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Operation Eden is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Operation Fractal is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find Prismorum, you will need to harvest common Prismocitae. Obviously, the more Prismocitae you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon Prismorum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of Prismorum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, Prismocitae) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Operation Eden is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find ilmenite, you will need to mine common titan ore. Obviously, the more titan ore you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon ilmenite. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of ilmenite we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, titan ore) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Operation Fractal is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nWhile harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find ilmenite, you will need to mine common titan ore. Obviously, the more titan ore you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon ilmenite. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of ilmenite we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, titan ore) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level00_exp3_03": "[i]Operation Eden is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nIt must be a piece of cake: we need you to create a mobile teleport accumulator, but first, gather all the requirements and components. Everything is marked on your map, just follow the orders and you will be ready in no time.\r\n\r\nDon't forget to give back the enclosed Calibration Template. To do so, you'll have to extract the CT from the factory line after the manufacturing process is done.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level00_exp3_03": "[i]Operation Fractal is not just a series of industrial assignments, but a great opportunity for you to practice mineral exploitation, harvesting, and production.[/i]\r\n\r\nIt must be a piece of cake: we need you to create a mobile teleport accumulator, but first, gather all the requirements and components. Everything is marked on your map, just follow the orders and you will be ready in no time.\r\n\r\nDon't forget to give back the enclosed Calibration Template. To do so, you'll have to extract the CT from the factory line after the manufacturing process is done.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_s_level00_exp3_01": "[i]Operation Belvedere is an excellent opportunity for us, suppliers to shine. Although we don't carry guns, or create remarkable devices, but the Perpetuum Project would surely collapse without our contribution.[/i]\r\n\r\nConsider this one as a test of your adherence. The package you need to carry holds the daily reports of a scout satellite. Travel to our receiver unit, remove the casket that holds the encrypted data, and bring it to one of our postal units. Do your job and you get paid.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_s_level00_exp3_02": "[i]Operation Belvedere is an excellent opportunity for us, suppliers to shine. Although we don't carry guns, or create remarkable devices, but the Perpetuum Project would surely collapse without our contribution.[/i]\r\n\r\nPlease find and scan a possible intruder for us. First, you'll have to fetch the scanner parameters by using an interface to know what you're looking for. After you've done it, you will be able to find the spy with your [b]equipped geoscanner and artifact scanner charges[/b]. If you find the spy squad, eliminate them and bring back everyhing you find.\n  ",
