  "missiondescription_tm_gen_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nYour first training assignment will be a basic scouting operation. After you've accepted this assignment and deployed onto the terrain, your only task will be to reach four different points on the terrain. This time there's no suggested robot, or equipment to pick, take anything you want to. Good luck, Agent! When you're ready, just come back for more assignments!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_gen_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nYour first training assignment will be a basic scouting operation. After you've accepted this assignment and deployed onto the terrain, your only task will be to reach four different points on the terrain. This time there's no suggested robot, or equipment to pick, take anything you want to. Good luck, Agent! When you're ready, just come back for more assignments!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_gen_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nYour first training assignment will be a basic scouting operation. After you've accepted this assignment and deployed onto the terrain, your only task will be to reach four different points on the terrain. This time there's no suggested robot, or equipment to pick, take anything you want to. Good luck, Agent! When you're ready, just come back for more assignments!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_gen_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nYour are about to take your very first combat assignment. During such assignments it is advised to equip the most powerful weapons available with plenty of ammunition, and also some defense modules, such as armor repairers.\r\n\r\nSome combat hints for starters: don't rush at your enemies. The first thing you should do is to measure the distance when they start locking you, so you will know where to retreat to avoid incoming hits, or try to move behind terrain obstacles. \r\n\r\nYour should check your weapons' optimal range as well, because over that optimal distance, your damage ratio will drop significantly.\r\n\r\nWith these things kept in mind, you should have no difficulties.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_gen_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nYour are about to take your very first combat assignment. During such assignments it is advised to equip the most powerful weapons available with plenty of ammunition, and also some defense modules, such as armor repairers.\r\n\r\nSome combat hints for starters: don't rush at your enemies. The first thing you should do is to measure the distance when they start locking you, so you will know where to retreat to avoid incoming hits, or try to move behind terrain obstacles. \r\n\r\nYour should check your weapons' optimal range as well, because over that optimal distance, your damage ratio will drop significantly.\r\n\r\nWith these things kept in mind, you should have no difficulties.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_gen_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nYour are about to take your very first combat assignment. During such assignments it is advised to equip the most powerful weapons available with plenty of ammunition, and also some defense modules, such as armor repairers.\r\n\r\nSome combat hints for starters: don't rush at your enemies. The first thing you should do is to measure the distance when they start locking you, so you will know where to retreat to avoid incoming hits, or try to move behind terrain obstacles. \r\n\r\nYour should check your weapons' optimal range as well, because over that optimal distance, your damage ratio will drop significantly.\r\n\r\nWith these things kept in mind, you should have no difficulties.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_gen_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nNow it' time for some digging! Your first task will be to reveal the position of the most common Nian mineral, titan ore. First use your geoscanner to search for a suitable mining position, then start mining the hotspots and bring back some titan ore. To perform such a complex task, you will need certain tools as well, equipped on your robot:\r\n\r\n* a geoscanner of your choice\r\n* directional geoscanner charges for titan ore\r\n* tile-based geoscanner charges for titan ore\r\n* at least 1 miner module\r\n* plenty of titan ore miner charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\r\n\r\n[b]Use the directional geoscanner charge to determine the nearest titan mining field! This mission can be completed anywhere on the zone.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_gen_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nNow it' time for some digging! Your first task will be to reveal the position of the most common Nian mineral, titan ore. First use your geoscanner to search for a suitable mining position, then start mining the hotspots and bring back some titan ore. To perform such a complex task, you will need certain tools as well, equipped on your robot:\r\n\r\n* a geoscanner of your choice\r\n* directional geoscanner charges for titan ore\r\n* tile-based geoscanner charges for titan ore\r\n* at least 1 miner module\r\n* plenty of titan ore miner charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\r\n\r\n[b]Use the directional geoscanner charge to determine the nearest titan mining field! This mission can be completed anywhere on the zone.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_gen_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nNow it' time for some digging! Your first task will be to reveal the position of the most common Nian mineral, titan ore. First use your geoscanner to search for a suitable mining position, then start mining the hotspots and bring back some titan ore. To perform such a complex task, you will need certain tools as well, equipped on your robot:\r\n\r\n* a geoscanner of your choice\r\n* directional geoscanner charges for titan ore\r\n* tile-based geoscanner charges for titan ore\r\n* at least 1 miner module\r\n* plenty of titan ore miner charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\r\n\r\n[b]Use the directional geoscanner charge to determine the nearest titan mining field! This mission can be completed anywhere on the zone.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_gen_tutorial_exp3_04": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nFor this task, we need a reliable transporter, just like you. The assignment is simple and easy, go to the designated point, fetch the SynSec container, and deliver it to another marked depot. To activate a designated landmark, click on the [b]interact[/b] function button. To submit an item, open both your robot's cargo hold and the terrain container, and simply drag the item icon into the interactive landmark.\r\n\r\nThe content of the package is not important right now, but try to be fast.\n  ",
