  "missiondescription_asi_gen_tutorial_exp3_04": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nFor this task, we need a reliable transporter, just like you. The assignment is simple and easy, go to the designated point, fetch the SynSec container, and deliver it to another marked depot. To activate a designated landmark, click on the [b]interact[/b] function button. To submit an item, open both your robot's cargo hold and the terrain container, and simply drag the item icon into the interactive landmark.\r\n\r\nThe content of the package is not important right now, but try to be fast.\n  ",
