  "missiondescription_tm_gen_tutorial_exp3_05": "[i]General training assignments will give you a basic overview of every important profession and work process from basic transport to combat, or industry. Upon completing the general assignments, you will have the opportunity to take special combat and industrial assignment lines that will provide you a valuable reward![/i]\r\n\r\nWe need a copy of one of the teleports' database for traffic analysis. It's not possible to download it remotely, so you will have to go there in person - or should I say \"in robot\". The automated system will put the data storage into a secure container, bring it back here to complete the assignment.\n  ",
