  "missiondescription_tm_w_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nWell, you've reached this phase, so the next one won't be hard for you: as you've reached the marked point, destroy the designated drones. These robots are not considered to be dangerous, but ensuring huge firepower and some preventive defense will not hurt anyone but your enemies.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nWell, you've reached this phase, so the next one won't be hard for you: as you've reached the marked point, destroy the designated drones. These robots are not considered to be dangerous, but ensuring huge firepower and some preventive defense will not hurt anyone but your enemies.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nWell, you've reached this phase, so the next one won't be hard for you: as you've reached the marked point, destroy the designated drones. These robots are not considered to be dangerous, but ensuring huge firepower and some preventive defense will not hurt anyone but your enemies.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_w_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis one is a bit more complicated, than the previous one, you'll have to focus on the target's AI console. As you may have noticed, these alien drones are quite similar to our drone fleet, but these are commanded by the Pelistal HQ. If you manage to destroy your drone target, open the remained container and take the console that holds the AI.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis one is a bit more complicated, than the previous one, you'll have to focus on the target's AI console. As you may have noticed, these alien drones are quite similar to our drone fleet, but these are commanded by the Nuimqol HQ. If you manage to destroy your drone target, open the remained container and take the console that holds the AI.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis one is a bit more complicated, than the previous one, you'll have to focus on the target's AI console. As you may have noticed, these alien drones are quite similar to our drone fleet, but these are commanded by the Thelodica HQ. If you manage to destroy your drone target, open the remained container and take the console that holds the AI.\n  ",
  "def_missionitem_tm_w_tutorial_exp3_02_t03": "Drone AI console [T-M Combat II]\n  ",
