  "missiondescription_tm_w_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nSome Pelistal drones have managed to obtain one of our teleports' security codes. Your first task will be to upload the new, enclosed codes to the marked interface. When you're done, travel to the cracked teleport transmit node, and restart the system manually.\r\n\r\nWhen the system is back online, get rid of the spies, before they get out of the zone.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nSome Nuimqol drones have managed to obtain one of our teleports' security codes. Your first task will be to upload the new, enclosed codes to the marked interface. When you're done, travel to the cracked teleport transmit node, and restart the system manually.\r\n\r\nWhen the system is back online, get rid of the spies, before they get out of the zone.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nSome Thelodica drones have managed to obtain one of our teleports' security codes. Your first task will be to upload the new, enclosed codes to the marked interface. When you're done, travel to the cracked teleport transmit node, and restart the system manually.\r\n\r\nWhen the system is back online, get rid of the spies, before they get out of the zone.\n  ",
