  "missiondescription_tm_w_tutorial_exp3_05": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nWe've found an ideal job for you: two of our training robots have become uncontrollable and left the primary training area. These robots were used by the Syndicate to familiarize Agents with the \"energy drainer\" technology, but since their escape, we're worried that they might cause unnecessary damages to Syndicate property.\r\n\r\nFirst, travel to an interface where you can get the robots' position. When you get the location, you still need to identify the robots by using a [b]previously equipped chassis scanner[/b]. When you get the green light, destroy both of them. Don't forget, these robots are equipped with [b]energy drainers[/b]. Watch your accumulator!\n  ",
