  "missiondescription_tm_w_tutorial_exp3_06": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nYour very final combat training assignment will be to test a special distress beacon on your own. Such distress beacons are used by the aliens to call in reinforcements, but we constantly use them to deceive and ambush the incoming forces.\r\n\r\nThe task is not complicated at all. First, you'll have to grab the distress beacon, then travel to the designated testing area. When you get in the marked area, open your robot's container, deploy the beacon, and interact with it. Be prepared for a tough combat with whatever comes through the channel!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_tutorial_exp3_06": "[i]Combat-based assignments are ideal to practice every important combat element, but that's not all: by completing all combat training assignments, the Syndicate will grant you a brand new combat specialized light robot, absolutely free of charge.[/i]\r\n\r\nYour very final combat training assignment will be to test a special distress beacon on your own. Such distress beacons are used by the aliens to call in reinforcements, but we constantly use them to deceive and ambush the incoming forces.\r\n\r\nThe task is not complicated at all. First, you'll have to grab the distress beacon, then travel to the designated testing area. When you get in the marked area, open your robot's container, deploy the beacon, and interact with it. Be prepared for a tough combat with whatever comes through the channel!\n  ",
