  "missiondescription_tm_i_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nYour first industrial training assignment will be quite similar to the one you've completed before, you need to search for a raw material. This time we need HDT - find a field with the help of directional and tile-based geoscanner charges, and bring some units back to the terminal.\r\n\r\nTo complete this task, you will need special tools:\r\n\r\n* a geoscanner of your choice\r\n* directional geoscanner charges for HDT\r\n* tile-based geoscanner charges for HDT\r\n* at least one miner module\r\n* plenty of HDT miner charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nYour first industrial training assignment will be quite similar to the one you've completed before, you need to search for a raw material. This time we need imentium - find a field with the help of directional and tile-based geoscanner charges, and bring some units back to the terminal.\r\n\r\nTo complete this task, you will need special tools:\r\n\r\n* a geoscanner of your choice\r\n* directional geoscanner charges for imentium\r\n* tile-based geoscanner charges for imentium\r\n* at least one miner module\r\n* plenty of imentium miner charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_tutorial_exp3_01": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nYour first industrial training assignment will be quite similar to the one you've completed before, you need to search for a raw mineral. This time we need stermonit - find a field with the help of directional and tile-based geoscanner charges, and bring some units back to the terminal.\r\n\r\nTo complete this task, you will need special tools:\r\n\r\n* a geoscanner of your choice\r\n* directional geoscanner charges for stermonit\r\n* tile-based geoscanner charges for stermonit\r\n* at least one miner module\r\n* plenty of stermonit miner charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\n  ",
