  "missiondescription_tm_i_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nIf we're not mistaken, this will be your very first harvesting assignment. The process of collecting organic plants - compared to mining - is simple and hard at the same time. Simple, because finding the precious material doesn't need any searching tool (eg. geoscanner). Harder, because the flora of the planet changes more rapidly than the mineral density, so you might have to travel more, to find new spots. When you find a plant, lock the tile below it and activate your harvester module. It's as easy as it sounds.\r\n\r\nTo be specific, we need you to find helioptris, a generally green plant with bright purple yield. The assignment requires:\r\n\r\n* at least 1 harvester\r\n* universal harvester charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nIf we're not mistaken, this will be your very first harvesting assignment. The process of collecting organic plants - compared to mining - is simple and hard at the same time. Simple, because finding the precious material doesn't need any searching tool (eg. geoscanner). Harder, because the flora of the planet changes more rapidly than the mineral density, so you might have to travel more, to find new spots. When you find a plant, lock the tile below it and activate your harvester module. It's as easy as it sounds.\r\n\r\nTo be specific, we need you to find helioptris, a generally green plant with bright purple yield. The assignment requires:\r\n\r\n* at least 1 harvester\r\n* universal harvester charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_tutorial_exp3_02": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nIf we're not mistaken, this will be your very first harvesting assignment. The process of collecting organic plants - compared to mining - is simple and hard at the same time. Simple, because finding the precious material doesn't need any searching tool (eg. geoscanner). Harder, because the flora of the planet changes more rapidly than the mineral density, so you might have to travel more, to find new spots. When you find a plant, lock the tile below it and activate your harvester module. It's as easy as it sounds.\r\n\r\nTo be specific, we need you to find triandlus, a brownish tentacle-like plant. The assignment requires:\r\n\r\n* at least 1 harvester\r\n* universal harvester charges (at least 30 suggested)\r\n\r\n[b]If you lack any of these, check the local market, there you will find them.[/b]\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nWithout transport lines connecting exploitation and manufacturing sites, the current state of our production would barely reach a satisfactory level. Your curent job will be to carry a container of prototypes from an automated site to a processing bay. To finish this assignment, you will only need a robot with large and empty cargo.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nWithout transport lines connecting exploitation and manufacturing sites, the current state of our production would barely reach a satisfactory level. Your curent job will be to carry a container of prototypes from an automated site to a processing bay. To finish this assignment, you will only need a robot with large and empty cargo.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_tutorial_exp3_03": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nWithout transport lines connecting exploitation and manufacturing sites, the current state of our production would barely reach a satisfactory level. Your curent job will be to carry a container of prototypes from an automated site to a processing bay. To finish this assignment, you will only need a robot with large and empty cargo.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_tutorial_exp3_04": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis assignment will introduce an important session of manufacturing, the Reverse Engineering. At the end of the RE process, items of unknown technology will become ready for mass production.\r\n\r\nYour first task will be to get this \"unknown item\", then, if you succeed you will have to reverse engineer that item. To initiate the process, travel back to a terminal where you can find a [b]Reverse Engineering[/b] among the available facilities. Upon opening the facility window, you have to drag the item, then a [b]decoder[/b] to start.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the process, you will receive a Calibration Template of the original item. That Calibration Template is what we need.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_tutorial_exp3_04": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis assignment will introduce an important session of manufacturing, the Reverse Engineering. At the end of the RE process, items of unknown technology will become ready for mass production.\r\n\r\nYour first task will be to get this \"unknown item\", then, if you succeed you will have to reverse engineer that item. To initiate the process, travel back to a terminal where you can find a [b]Reverse Engineering[/b] among the available facilities. Upon opening the facility window, you have to drag the item, then a [b]decoder[/b] to start.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the process, you will receive a Calibration Template of the original item. That Calibration Template is what we need.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_tutorial_exp3_04": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis assignment will introduce an important session of manufacturing, the Reverse Engineering. At the end of the RE process, items of unknown technology will become ready for mass production.\r\n\r\nYour first task will be to get this \"unknown item\", then, if you succeed you will have to reverse engineer that item. To initiate the process, travel back to a terminal where you can find a [b]Reverse Engineering[/b] among the available facilities. Upon opening the facility window, you have to drag the item, then a [b]decoder[/b] to start.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the process, you will receive a Calibration Template of the original item. That Calibration Template is what we need.\n  ",
