  "missiondescription_asi_i_tutorial_exp3_05": "[i]Wars come and go, but creating will always remain a noble and profitable profession. These training assignments will hopefully persuade you to join the industry sector. If you manage to finish all the industrial assignments, the Syndicate will reward you with an industrial light robot.[/i]\r\n\r\nThis last assignment will be your most complicated so far, you'll have to create a compressor on your own. This item has two basic components, a valve, and a casing. Collect these two first from a marked depot.\r\n\r\nWhen you have the components, travel to a terminal with an available [b]Factory[/b]. Open the factory's management window, and simply drag the enclosed Calibration Template to the factory. Now you can check the component requirements of the compressor - the components you've collected. Note that the factory can only use components from your [b]private storage[/b], so you have to move the valve and the casket from the robot's cargo to your private storage.\r\n\r\nFrom that point the task is simple: start the manufacturing process. When the compressor is done, you'll have to [color=#ff8a00][b]extract[/b][/color] the Calibration Template (right-click on the CT to reach this function). To complete this assignment, you'll have to deliver both the compressor and the CT.\n  ",
