  "missiondescription_tm_i_level04_exp3_01": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level04_exp3_01": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find olyclin, you will need to harvest common helioptris. Obviously, the more heloptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level04_exp3_01": "While harvesting common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find vespersit, you will need to harvest common triandlus. Obviously, the more triandlus you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon vespersit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of vespersit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, triandlus) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level04_exp3_02": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find Silgium-2x, you will need to mine common Silgium. Obviously, the more Silgium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon Silgium-2x. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of Silgium-2x we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, Silgium) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level04_exp3_02": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find carcytum, you will need to mine common imentium. Obviously, the more imentium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon carcytum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of carcytum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, imentium) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level04_exp3_02": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find opacit, you will need to mine common stermonit. Obviously, the more stermonit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon opacit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of opacit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, stermonit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "def_missionitemmineral_silgiumshard_desc": "'''Silgium-2x is a special variant of the common silgium. There's a certain chance that you find silgium-2x when mining silgium.'''\r\n\r\nCurrent research shows that silgium-2x is a result of rare volcanic activities and is twice as dense as regular silgium, making it a good candidate in our research of future manufacturing technologies. Silgium-2x is a common objective of many industrial assignments. You can also recycle it to gain pure silgium.\n  ",
  "def_missionitemmineral_silgiumshard": "Silgium-2x\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level04_exp3_03": "The industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level04_exp3_03": "The industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level04_exp3_03": "The industrial corporation that offers the job is in need of fresh information about the exact location of underground materials. You're provided with the details: the area where you have to search, and the type of geoscanner charge you have to scan with. This one is supposed to be a peaceful mission, but be careful, who knows.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_w_level04_exp3_01": "Pelistals think they can fool us by sending decoys along with the carrier robot that is our original target. First, you got to take out a scout batallion we marked for you and take their assignment log.\r\n\r\nAfter you've acquired the log use a designated node to translate it. The decoded message will surely lead you to the VIP of the bunch that has our precious cargo. This is it for now, make haste, Agent!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_level04_exp3_01": "Nuimqols think they can fool us by sending decoys along with the carrier robot that is our original target. First, you got to take out a scout batallion we marked for you and take their assignment log.\r\n\r\nAfter you've acquired the log use a designated node to translate it. The decoded message will surely lead you to the VIP of the bunch that has our precious cargo. This is it for now, make haste, Agent!\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_level04_exp3_01": "Thelodicans think they can fool us by sending decoys along with the carrier robot that is our original target. First, you got to take out a scout batallion we marked for you and take their assignment log.\r\n\r\nAfter you've acquired the log use a designated node to translate it. The decoded message will surely lead you to the VIP of the bunch that has our precious cargo. This is it for now, make haste, Agent!\n  ",
