  "missiondescription_tm_w_level04_exp3_03": "We need your help on a little experiment here. We are about to construct a distress beacon with a unique frequency that leads directly to enemy high command. If we do it right, this is going to be our biggest hit so far with in the distress beacon project.\r\n\r\nFirst, you need to eliminate enemy threat at our testing area, then acquire the beacon. Bring the trap device to a safe spot, call in the big guys, and kill them all.\n  ",
