  "missiondescription_tm_s_level04_exp3_03": "Please help us to find a dangerous infiltrator group, we need a skilled Agent just like you!\r\n\r\nFirst, use the time locks to temporarily disable the automatic defense system so you can search for dangerous artifacts without triggering the inner alarm. After that, you have to pick up the system marker.\r\n\r\nNow comes the harder part: find the infiltrators with an artifact scanner and retrieve their holotracker at all cost!\n  ",
