  "missiondescription_tm_i_level05_exp3_01": "While harvesting common plants, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find vespersit, you will need to harvest common triandlus. Obviously, the more triandlus you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon vespersit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of vespersit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common plants (here, triandlus) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level05_exp3_01": "While harvesting common plants, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find Olyclin, you will need to harvest common Helioptris. Obviously, the more Helioptris you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon Olyclin. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of Olyclin we need for our research, deliver it. All the common plants (here, Helioptris) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level05_exp3_01": "While harvesting common plants, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find vespersit, you will need to harvest common triandlus. Obviously, the more triandlus you harvest, the more likely you will stumble upon vespersit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of vespersit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common plants (here, triandlus) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level05_exp3_02": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find Silgium-2x, you will need to mine common Silgium. Obviously, the more Silgium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon Silgium-2x. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of Silgium-2x we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, Silgium) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level05_exp3_02": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find carcytum, you will need to mine common imentium. Obviously, the more imentium you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon carcytum. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of carcytum we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, imentium) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level05_exp3_02": "While mining common minerals, you may occasionally find rare variants. The Syndicate has recently begun research to find the best ways to utilize these new minerals.\r\n\r\nTo find opacit, you will need to mine common stermonit. Obviously, the more stermonit you mine, the more likely you will stumble upon opacit. If you manage to acquire the specified amount of opacit we need for our research, deliver it. All the common minerals (here, stermonit) you mine in that time is yours.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_tm_i_level05_exp3_03": "The upcoming task will be pretty complex, but we're sure you will succeed. First, you have to obtain an item by using an artifact scanner. We believe that you will be able to reverse engineer it, and then create multiple copies of it in a factory.\r\n\r\nWaste no time Agent - collect the item and the required components, and create some more of it!\r\n\r\nWhen you're done, extract the CT from the factory and deliver it for us too, so we can use it for further production.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_i_level05_exp3_03": "The upcoming task will be pretty complex, but we're sure you will succeed. First, you have to obtain an item by using an artifact scanner. We believe that you will be able to reverse engineer it, and then create multiple copies of it in a factory.\r\n\r\nWaste no time Agent - collect the item and the required components, and create some more of it!\r\n\r\nWhen you're done, extract the CT from the factory and deliver it for us too, so we can use it for further production.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_i_level05_exp3_03": "The upcoming task will be pretty complex, but we're sure you will succeed. First, you have to obtain an item by using an artifact scanner. We believe that you will be able to reverse engineer it, and then create multiple copies of it in a factory.\r\n\r\nWaste no time Agent - collect the item and the required components, and create some more of it!\r\n\r\nWhen you're done, extract the CT from the factory and deliver it for us too, so we can use it for further production.\n  ",
