  "missiondescription_tm_w_level05_exp3_02": "The way to your primary target is hard, but you also have to tackle its bodyguards. First you have to take out the advance party and acquire their supplies. If you succeed, there is nothing left to stop you: take out the elite guards and collect their scalps!\n  ",
