  "missiondescription_tm_w_level05_exp3_01": "We have put together a nice invitation package to the Pelistal raider batallions. First, you need to bring the enclosed emitter unit to a comm. station, that will attract the intruders.\r\n\r\nWhen the emitter is in place, you can take the first couple of raiders easily, but their officer will not show itself unless you use the Bait beacon as a bait.\r\n\r\nArm yourself, do as you are told, and you will succeed.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_ics_w_level05_exp3_01": "We have put together a nice invitation package to the Nuimqol raider batallions. First, you need to bring the enclosed emitter unit to a comm. station, that will attract the intruders.\r\n\r\nWhen the emitter is in place, you can take the first couple of raiders easily, but their officer will not show itself unless you use the Bait beacon as a bait.\r\n\r\nArm yourself, do as you are told, and you will succeed.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_asi_w_level05_exp3_01": "We have put together a nice invitation package to the Thelodica raider batallions. First, you need to bring the enclosed emitter unit to a comm. station, that will attract the intruders.\r\n\r\nWhen the emitter is in place, you can take the first couple of raiders easily, but their officer will not show itself unless you use the Bait beacon as a bait.\r\n\r\nArm yourself, do as you are told, and you will succeed.\n  ",
