  "missiondescription_tm_w_level01_daily_01": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours.[/i]\r\n\r\nAgent, the number of enemy forces on the island is rapidly increasing! We need you to go out there and eliminate a certain number of opposition.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_daily_w_01": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours. Also, these missions can be completed anywhere within the zone where the mission is provided to you.[/i]\r\n\r\nAgent, the number of enemy forces on the island is rapidly increasing! We need you to go out there and eliminate a certain number of opposition.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_daily_w_02": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours. Also, these missions can be completed anywhere within the zone where the mission is provided to you.[/i]\r\n\r\nCertain robotic elements are frequently used in our production facilities. We offer reasonable amount of NIC to any person who can provide our daily needs.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_daily_i_01": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours. Also, these missions can be completed anywhere within the zone where the mission is provided to you.[/i]\r\n\r\nOur scientists are making continuous progress in the research of special mineral variants, and we already have found important uses for some of them in our day-to-day manufacturing processes. However, due to their rare nature, we are unable to gather enough to keep both our production and our research running. We need your help with this, Agent.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_daily_i_02": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours. Also, these missions can be completed anywhere within the zone where the mission is provided to you.[/i]\r\n\r\nOur scientists are making continuous progress in the research of special mineral variants, and we already have found important uses for some of them in our day-to-day manufacturing processes. However, due to their rare nature, we are unable to gather enough to keep both our production and our research running. We need your help with this, Agent.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_daily_s_01": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours. Also, these missions can be completed anywhere within the zone where the mission is provided to you.[/i]\r\n\r\nAgent, we need fresh information from the enemies roaming within our territories. Here's a list of enemy robot types we need scan info on. Provide us this critical intelligence, and you will be rewarded.\n  ",
  "missiondescription_daily_s_02": "[i]Daily missions require you to complete generic tasks to keep the enemy forces in bay or to sustain the material needs of the local industrial buildings. Once you complete these missions you won't be able to pick them up again for the next 23 hours. Also, these missions can be completed anywhere within the zone where the mission is provided to you.[/i]\r\n\r\nImportant equipment and goods are being lost daily to enemy patrols and attacking squads. Retrieving this equipment is a continuous struggle, and we need your help with it.\n  ",
