  "tutorialchecklist_complex_thelodicarobots_trigger06_title": "Destroy a Drone\n  ",
  "tutorialchecklist_complex_pelistalrobots_trigger01_title": "Right-click the Tyrannos in your private storage and select “Activate”\n  ",
