  "productionmill_line_targetquantity": "Products per cycle\n  ",
  "productionmill_manufacture_targetquantity": "Produced items:\n  ",
  "tutorialchecklist_advanced_artifacts_trigger03_desc": "The scanner shows a list of '''artifact signals''' around you that are within range. The one we’re looking for here is called '''“Training artifact”'''.\r\n\r\nThe artifact scanner shows distances and directions, but the accuracy of these readings depend on your equipment and your distance from the artifact. The further you are, the more deviation there can be in your readings.\r\n\r\n[[Image:checklist_artifact.jpg|center|nolink]]\r\nWith the help of the direction indicator, try to get closer to the scanned location and once you're close enough, do another scan. Your readings should be much more accurate because you got closer, but with a little luck you may even find the artifact right away - if you're near enough, the artifact will appear on your next scan.\r\n\r\n''Hint: it’s going to be around a rotating building.''\n  ",
